<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">RRK05.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">EKY'EBIRAGIRO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Musa Ekya Kataano Ekirikwetwa Eky'ebiragiro Obwa Kabiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">Eky'Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bir</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA MUSA EKYA KATAANO EKIRIKWETWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKY'EBIRAGIRO obwa kabiri</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okubaijutsya ebyabaireho omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Ebi nibyo bigambo ebi Musa yaagambiire Abaisraeli boona bari seeri ya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amakuru g'ekigambo “obwa kabiri” n'okugaruka omu Biragiro ebi Musa yaabandize kubaha, bakiri aha rushozi Sinai. </char></note>Yorudani omu ihamba rya Araba ahashungaine na Suufu ahagati ya Parani, Tofeli, Labaani, Hazeroosi na Dizahaabu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amakuru g'ekigambo “obwa kabiri” n'okugaruka omu Biragiro ebi Musa yaabandize kubaha, bakiri aha rushozi Sinai. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Okuruga Horebu okuhika Kadeshi-barunea, orabire aha rushozi Seiri, n'orugyendo rw'ebiro ikumi na kimwe. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:38">Kub 33:38</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwaka gwa makumi ana omu kwezi kwa ikumi na kumwe, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, Musa akagambira Abaisraeli ebi MUKAMA yaamuragiire kubagambira byona, nk'oku byabaire biri; <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:11">Zab 135:11</ref>. </char></note> yaabimugambira aherize kusingura Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori, owaabaire atwire Heshibooni, na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani owaabaire atwire Ashitaroosi omuri Edurei; <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Musa yaatandika kushoboorora ebiragiro ebyo, ari omu nsi ya Moabu seeri ya Yorudani, naagira ati:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu akatugambirira Horebu, naagira ati: Omwanya ogu mumazire ahari oru rushozi ni muhango munonga; <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />muhindukye, mwimutsye orugyendo, muze omu nsi y'ebibungo ey'Abaamori n'ahandi hoona ahahereraine naho, omuri Araba, n'omu nsi y'ebibungo, n'omu mpita, na Negebu n'omu mpita z'aha rubaju rw'Enyanja Empango, omu nsi y'Abanyakanaani, n'aha rushozi Lebanooni, muhikye n'aha mugyera muhango Furaati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Reeba, egyo nsi ngitaire omu maisho gaanyu; mugizemu, mukubuure egyo nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo, na baijukuru baabo abarikurataho.<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:14">Kub 11:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naanye obwo nkabagira nti: Tindikubaasa kubaheeka nyenka; <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:22">Bir 10:22</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abakanyiise; reeba hati muri baingi nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe abakanyise emirundi rukumi okukira oku muri, kandi abahe omugisha, nk'oku yaabaraganiise. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:7">1 Bag 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:28">2 Kor 11:28</ref>. </char></note> Nimbaasa nta kwemera oburemeezi bwanyu n'empaka zaanyu ebirikumpenda? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Mutoorane abanyabwengye, abarikwetegyereza kandi abarikumanywa, nk'enganda zaanyu oku ziri, mbateho kuba abeebembezi baanyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mwangarukamu muti: Ebi waagamba ni birungi itwe kubikora. <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Naanye nikwo kutwara abakuru b'enganda zaanyu, abanyabwengye kandi abarikumanywa, nkabahindura abeebembezi baanyu, abamwe kutegyeka buri omwe rukumi, abandi igana, abandi ataano n'abandi ikumi, kandi n'abakuru b'engabo, nk'oku enganda zaanyu ziri. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:24">Yoh 7:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obwo nkeehanangiriza abaramuzi baanyu, ningira nti: Mugume muhurire ebi beene waanyu barikufa, mucwere omuntu na mwene ishe n'omunyaihanga otwire nawe emanja z'oburyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 24:23">Enf 24:23</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:1">Yak 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:22">Kur 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Omu kucwa emanja kwanyu mutarishoroora omu bantu; muhurire abataine kitiinisa n'abakiine nimubainganisa; mutaritiina amaisho g'omuntu, ahabw'okuba okucwa orubanja n'okwa Ruhanga; kandi emanja eziribarema, mugume muzindeetere, naanye ndyazihurira. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Kandi omu bunaku obwo nkabaragiira byona ebi mushemereire kukora.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:15">Bir 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:6">Yer 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima twaruga Horebu, twaraba omuri eryo ihamba ryona erihango eririkutiinisa, eri mwareebire nimuza omu nsi y'ebibungo y'Abaamori, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaaturagiire; twahika Kadeshi-barunea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ku twahikireyo, naabagira nti: Mwaija omu nsi y'ebibungo ey'Abaamori, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikutuha. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:1">Isa 43:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:32">Luk 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:6">Heb 13:6</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ataire egyo nsi omu maisho gaanyu; mwinamukye, mugikubuure, nka MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe oku yaabagambiire; mutatiina, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima. <verse eid="DEU 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Bwanyima mwena mwanyirira haihi, mwagira muti: Ka tutume abantu batubandizeyo, batutatire ensi, bagarukye batugambire omuhanda ogu turaatoore nitwinamuka, n'endembo ezi turaahikyemu. <verse eid="DEU 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Ekigambo ekyo kyangwisa gye munonga, naabaihamu abantu ikumi na babiri, omwe omuri buri ruganda. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Baahinduka, bainamuka omu nsi y'ebibungo, baahika omu ruhanga rwa Eshikooli, baarutata. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Baiha aha bijuma by'egyo nsi, baabitureetera omu ngaro zaabo, kandi baatureetera n'enkuru nungi nibagira bati: Ensi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikutuha ni nungi.<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">Kub 14:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe mwayanga kwinamuka, mwagomera ekiragiro kya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />mwayetomboitera omu mahema gaanyu nimugira muti: Ruhanga ahabw'okutwanga akatwiha omu nsi ya Misri okutuhayo omu mikono y'Abaamori kutucwekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:1">Bir 9:1</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 9:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Nitwinamuka hi? Beene waitu batumazire omutima omunda nibagira bati: Abo bantu ni bahango kandi ni baraingwa nibatukira; endembo zaabo ni mpango, kandi zeehinguririziibwe engo ezizitiire okuhika ahaiguru munonga; kandi tureebireyo beene Anaki. <verse eid="DEU 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Naanye nikwo kubagumya nimbagira nti: Mutagira obwoba, kandi mutabatiina. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:14">Kur 14:14</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:20">Neh 4:20</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu orikubeebembera niwe araabarwanirire, nk'ebi yaabakoreire omuri Misri byona nimureeba, oku byabaire biri, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 46:3">Isa 46:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 46:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:9">63:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'omu ihamba ahu mwareebeire oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaheekire, omu muhanda gwona ogu mwarabiremu okuhika aha, nk'oku omuntu aheeka omwana we. <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Kwonka n'obu ndaabe naabagambiire ekyo, timuraikiriize MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:14">Zab 78:14</ref>. </char></note> owaabeebembeire omu muhanda kubasherurira omwanya gw'okuteeramu amahema gaanyu, ari omu muriro nyekiro n'omu kicu nyomushana, kubahabura omuhanda ogu muraatooremu.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:11">Zab 95:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaahurira ebigambo byanyu, yaagira ekiniga, yaarahira ati: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />Buzimazima tihariho n'omwe omuri aba bantu ab'obusingye obu obubi orireeba egyo nsi nungi ei naarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />kureka Kalebu mwene Yefune niwe arigireeba; kandi ensi ei yaaribatsiremu ndyagimuha n'abaana be, ahabw'okuba akakuratirira kimwe MUKAMA. <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:14">Kub 27:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:26">Bir 3:26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naanye MUKAMA akangwerwa kubi ahabwanyu, yaagira ati: Naiwe torigihikamu. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Bir 31:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yoshua mwene Nuuni, omuheereza waawe niwe aritaahamu; omugumye, ahakuba niwe arihunguza Abaisraeli egyo nsi. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:20">Ezk 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaana baanyu abato abu mwagizire ngu baryaba eminyago, n'abaana baanyu abatakamanyire kirungi nari kibi, nibo barigitaahamu, kandi nibo ndigiha bakagikubuura. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Kwonka imwe muhindukye mugarukye omu ihamba, mutoore omuhanda ogurikuza aha Nyanja erikutukura.<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Bwanyima mwangarukamu nimugira muti: Tucumwire ahari MUKAMA; nitwija kwinamuka, turwane nk'ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaaturagiire byona oku biri. Buri muntu weena omuriimwe yaahagatira eby'okurwanisa bye, mwateekateeka ngu nikirahuka kwinamuka omu nsi y'ebibungo. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Obangirire oti: Mutainamuka, kandi mutarwana; ahakuba tindi muriimwe, mutakaitwa bazigu baanyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:44">Kub 14:44</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 14:45">45</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naabibagambira, kwonka timwabihurira, mwagomera ekiragiro kya MUKAMA, mwainamuka n'ekigaazo omuri egyo nsi y'ebibungo. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:30">Bir 32:30</ref>. </char></note> Abaamori abaabaire bagitwiremu baija kubarwanisa, baababinga nk'enjoki, baabaitira Seiri, baabahitsya Horuma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 66:18">Zab 66:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:7-14">Yer 11:7-14</ref>. </char></note> Mwagaruka, mwarira omu maisho ga MUKAMA; kwonka MUKAMA tiyaabeetaho n'obu kwakuba okubatega okutu. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Mutyo mwamara ebiro bingi muri Kadeshi, nk'ebiro ebi mwamazireyo oku byabaire nibiingana.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okubaijutsya eby'okuzengyerera kwabo n'engamba ezi baarwaniire omu ihamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Bwanyima twahinduka, twaimutsya orugyendo nituza omu ihamba, twatoora omuhanda ogurikuza aha Nyanja erikutukura, nk'oku MUKAMA yandagiire; twamara ebiro bingi nitwehinguririza orushozi Seiri. <verse eid="DEU 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />MUKAMA yangira ati: <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Omwanya ogu mumazire nimwehinguririza oru rushozi ni muhango munonga; mukiikame mutoore aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Kandi oragiire abantu oti: Mwaza kuraba omu nsi ya beene waanyu aba Esau, abatwire Seiri; bo baryabatiina; n'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde munonga, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:10-12">2 Bus 20:10-12</ref>. </char></note> mutaribarwanisa; ahakuba tindibaha ha nsi yaabo, n'obu haakuba ah'okuribata ekigyere; ahabw'okuba nkaha Esau orushozi Seiri kuba orwe. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Muryaguma mubashakyemu eby'okurya, mubone kurya, kandi mugure nabo amaizi, mubone kunywa. <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akakuha omugisha omu mirimo yoona ey'emikono yaawe, yaamanya engyendo zaawe ez'omuri eri ihamba rihango; kandi emyaka egi yoona makumi ana MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe agumire naiwe, otaine ki obuzire. <verse eid="DEU 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Tutyo twagumizamu, twayetantara beene waitu aba Esau, abatwire Seiri, twayetantara n'omuhanda ogurikuraba Araba niguruga Elaasi na Ezionigeberi; twakuba, twatoora omuhanda ogurikuza omu ihamba rya Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:36">Kut 19:36</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yangira ati: Mutarahura Abamoabu, mukabarwanisa; ahakuba tindibaha buhunguzi mu nsi yaabo, ahabw'okuba nkaha aba Looti ensi ya Aari kuba eyaabo. <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Obunyakare aba Emimu bakaba batwireyo, n'eihanga ry'amaani ery'abantu baingi kandi baraingwa nk'aba Anaki, <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />kandi bakaba nibeetwa aba Reefa nk'aba Anaki; kwonka Abamoabu bakabeeta aba Emimu. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Kandi obunyakare Abahoori nabo bakaba batwire Seiri, baabanyaga, baabaita, baatuura omu nsi yaabo, nk'Abaisraeli oku baakubwire ensi yaabo ei MUKAMA yaabahaire.) <verse eid="DEU 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mbwenu mwimukye, mwambukye akagyera Zeredi. Ako kagyera Zeredi twakambuka. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:33">Kub 14:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:33">Zab 78:33</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka ei twamazire okwiha obu twaruga Kadeshi-barunea okuhitsya obu twayambukire ako kagyera Zeredi, ekahika makumi ashatu na munaana; okuhitsya obu abarwani boona ab'obusingye obwo baahwereire kimwe omu nsiisira zaitu, nk'oku MUKAMA yaabagambiire naarahira. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:26">Zab 106:26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:11-19">Heb 3:11-19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:1-5">4:1-5</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima omukono gwa MUKAMA gukabarwanisa okubahwerekyerereza omu nsiisira zaitu, okuhitsya obu baahweireho.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Bwanyima abarwani boona ku baaherize kufa, baahwa omu bantu, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />MUKAMA yangira ati: <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />Eri izooba nimwija kuraba omuri Aari, mucwekanise omwatano gwa Moabu; <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />kandi ku oraahikye haihi n'Abaamoni, otabarahura, n'obu kwakuba okubarwanisa; ahakuba tindikuha buhunguzi omu nsi y'Abaamoni, ahabw'okuba nkagiha aba Looti kuba eyaabo. (<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Ensi egyo nayo neeyetwa ey'aba Reefa; obunyakare aba Reefa bakaba bagitwiremu; kwonka Abaamoni hati nibabeeta Abazamuzumi; <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />rikaba riri eihanga ry'amaani, ery'abantu baingi kandi baraingwa nk'aba Anaki; kwonka MUKAMA akabacwekyerereza omu maisho g'Abaamoni, baabanyaga, baatuura omu nsi yaabo, <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />nk'oku yaagiriire aba Esau, abatwire Seiri, obu yaacwekyerereza aba Hoori omu maisho gaabo, bakabanyaga, bakatuura omu nsi yaabo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Kandi n'aba Avimu, abaabaire batwire omu birorero okuhika Gaaza, aba Kafutoori, abaarugire Kafutoori, bakabacwekyereza, baatuura omu nsi yaabo.) <verse eid="DEU 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwimukye mugyende, mwambukye oruhanga rwa Arunooni; reeba naahayo Sihooni Omuamori, omugabe wa Heshibooni, n'ensi ye omu mikono yaawe; otandikye kumurwanisa n'okukubuura ensi ye. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:25">Bir 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:9">Yos 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Eri izooba niinyija kwitsa amahanga agari ahansi y'eiguru obwoba n'okugatiinisa ahabwawe; nibaija kuhurira okurangaanwa kwawe, bateteme, bagire amaganya maingi ahabwawe.<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 20:10">Bir 20:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku twabaire tukiri omu ihamba rya Kedemoosi, naatuma entumwa ahari Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni ebigambo by'obusingye, ningira nti: <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:19">Bar 11:19</ref>. </char></note> Onyikirize, ndabe omu nsi yaawe; niinyija kutoora omuhanda rugyendwa, tindikwija kukiikama aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Eby'okurya oryabinguza nkuhe empiiha, mbone kurya; n'amaizi oganguze nkuhe empiiha, mbone kunywa; kwonka ondekye, ndabemu n'ebigyere, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />nk'aba Esau abatwire Seiri, n'Abamoabu abatwire Aari, oku bangiriire, okuhitsya obu ndyambuka Yorudani, nkahika omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikutuha. <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:23">Kub 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:19">Yos 11:19</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 11:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni yaayanga kutureka kuraba omu nsi ye, ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akamugangaaza omutima, yaamutizya, ngu abone kumuhayo omu mukono gwawe, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="DEU 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Reeba, naatandika kuhayo Sihooni n'ensi ye omu maisho gaawe; naiwe otandikye kugikubuura, obone kugihungura. <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Bwanyima Sihooni yaija n'engabo ze zoona kuturwanisiza ahari Yahazi. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:7">Bir 29:7</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaamuhayo omu maisho gaitu, twamwita n'abatabani n'abantu be boona. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:2">Kub 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2">Bir 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1 Sam 15:3-9</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo twakwata endembo ze zoona, twazicwekyerereza kimwe, abashaija, n'abakazi n'abaana; titwatsigamu na wa kizira. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Kureka amatungo gonka nigo twayenyagiire hamwe n'ebi twanyagire omu ndembo ezi twakwatsire. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:3">Zab 44:3</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga Aroeri eri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni, n'okuruga aha rurembo oruri omuri orwo ruhanga, okuhika Gileadi, tihaagira rurembo rwaturema ahabw'oburaingwa bwarwo. MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaazihayo zoona omu maisho gaitu. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kwonka tiwaahika haihi n'ensi y'Abaamoni, n'obu haakuba aha nkungu z'omugyera Yaboki, nari endembo z'omu nsi y'ebibungo, n'ahandi hoona ahu MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaatuzibiire.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okubaijutsya ebitsigaire aha rugyendo rwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Bwanyima twakuba, twatoora omuhanda ogurikwinamuka Bashani; Ogi omugabe wa Bashani yaija n'engabo ze zoona kuturwanisiza omuri Edurei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Otamutiina; ahakuba naamuhayo n'abantu be boona n'ensi ye omu mukono gwawe; omugire nk'oku waagizire Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori owaabaire atwire Heshibooni. <verse eid="DEU 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Atyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaahayo na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani n'abantu be boona omu mikono yaitu; twabaita, tiyaahonoraho n'omwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Omu bunaku obwo twakwata endembo ze zoona; tihaatsigaraho rurembo na rumwe oru tutarabanyagire – endembo makumi mukaaga, ekyaro kyona ekya Arugoobi, obugabe bwa Ogi omuri Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Ezo zoona zikaba ziri endembo ezizitiire n'engo ndaingwa, ziine amarembo g'enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi, otabariireho birorero bingi munonga ebitaine ngo. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Twazicwekyerereza kimwe, nk'oku twagizire Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni, nitucwekyereza buri rurembo, abashaija n'abakazi n'abaana. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Kwonka amatungo goona, n'ebi twanyagire omu rurembo, twabyetwarira kuba eminyago. <verse eid="DEU 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Tutyo omuri obwo bunaku twakubuura ensi z'abo bagabe b'Abaamori bombi, abaabaire batwire seenu ya Yorudani, okwiha aha ruhanga rwa Arunooni, okuhika aha rushozi Herumooni; <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(orwo rushozi Herumooni Abasidoni bakaba barweta Sirioni, n'Abaamori barweta Seniiri;) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />kandi twakwata endembo zoona ez'omu ruhita, na Gileadi yoona, na Bashani yoona okuhika Saleka n'omuri Edurei, endembo z'omu bugabe bwa Ogi omuri Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:9">Amo 2:9</ref>. </char></note> (Ahabw'okuba Ogi omugabe wa Bashani niwe wenka owaabaire akiriho omu ba Reefa abaatsigaireho; ekitanda kye kikaba kiri eky'ebyoma; tikiri omuri Rabba ey'Abaamoni? Oburaingwa bwakyo bukaba buri mikono mwenda, n'obuhango bwakyo mikono ena, nk'orugyero rw'abantu orwa mukono gumwe oku ruri.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Ku twakubwire egyo nsi omu bunaku obwo, naaha aba Reubeeni n'aba Gaadi ekyanga ekirikutandikira Aroeri eri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni n'ekicweka ky'ensi y'ebibungo ya Gileadi n'endembo zaamwo. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Ekicweka kya Gileadi ekyatsigaireho na Bashani yoona, obugabe bwa Ogi, naabiha ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, ekyanga kyona kya Arugoobi, niyo Bashani yoona. (Egyo nsi ekaba neeyetwa ensi y'aba Reefa. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yairi mwene Manaase yaatwara ekyaro kyona ekya Arugoobi, niyo Bashani, okuhika aha mwatano gw'aba Geshuri n'aba Maakasi, yaakyeyeterera, kyayetwa Havosi-yairi n'okuhitsya hati.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Kandi naaha Makiri Gileadi. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Aba Reubeeni n'aba Gaadi naabaha okuruga ahari Gileadi okuhika aha ruhanga rwa Arunooni, omwatano gwayo gwaraba ahagati y'orwo ruhanga, gwahika aha mugyera Yaboki, ogurikubaatanisa n'Abaamoni; <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />kandi naabaha Araba, omwatano gwayo gwaba Yorudani, okuruga Kinereesi okuhika aha nyanja ya Araba, niyo Nyanja y'Omwonyo, ahansi y'orushozi Pisiga aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Omu bunaku obwo nkabaragiira, ningira nti: MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahaire ensi egi kugikubuura; abashaija baanyu amamanzi baryayambuka bakwaitse eby'okurwanisa beebembeire beene waanyu Abaisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Kwonka abakazi baanyu n'abaana baanyu n'amatungo gaanyu, – (nimmanya ku mwine amatungo maingi) biryaguma omu ndembo zaanyu, ezi naabahaire, <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:4">Yos 22:4</ref>. </char></note> okuhitsya obu MUKAMA ariha beene waanyu okuhuumura, nk'oku yaakubahaire, nabo bakakubuura ensi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha seeri ya Yorudani; bwanyima muryagaruka buri muntu omu butaka bwe obu mbahaire. <verse eid="DEU 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Omu bunaku obwo nkaragiira Yoshua ningira nti: Amaisho gaawe geereebeire byona ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu akozire abo bagabe bombi; kandi nikwo MUKAMA arigira obugabe bwona omu nsi ei murikwambukamu. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:30">Bir 1:30</ref>. </char></note> Mutaribatiina; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe abarwanirira.<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Omu bunaku obwo nkeeshengyereza MUKAMA ningira nti: <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 145:3">Zab 145:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 145:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:18-21">Yer 32:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:19">Zab 71:19</ref>. </char></note> Ai Mukama RUHANGA, otandikire kworeka omwiru waawe obukuru bwawe n'omukono gwawe ogw'amaani; ahakuba ni ruhanga ki omu iguru nari aha nsi, orikubaasa kukora emirimo nk'eyaawe, kandi n'eby'amaani ebi waakozire oku biri? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Ninkweshengyereza onyikirize nyambukye, ndeebe ensi egyo enungi eri seeri ya Yorudani, n'ebyo bibungo birungi na Lebanooni. <verse eid="DEU 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:8">2 Kor 12:8</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA yangwerwa kubi ahabwanyu, tiyaanyikiriza; yangira ati: Rekyera aho, otagaruka kungambira ahari ekyo kigambo. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Inamuka oze aha mutwe gwa Pisiga, onagye amaisho oburengyerwa-izooba, n'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'aha bwa buryo, n'oburugwa-izooba, oreebe n'amaisho gaawe; ahakuba toryambuka Yorudani egi. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:18">Kub 27:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka oyehanangirize Yoshua, omwezirikise, omugumye; ahabw'okuba niwe aryambuka ayebembeire aba bantu, akabahunguza ensi ei oraareebe. <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Tutyo twaguma omu ruhanga orushungaine na Besi-peori.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okwehanangiriza kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 20:11">Ezk 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:5">Rom 10:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, Baisraeli 'mwe, muhurire ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi ndikubeegyesa, mubyorobere, mubone kugumaho n'okutaaha omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe arikubaha, mugikubuure. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:9">Mat 15:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:18">Kush 22:18</ref>. </char></note> Mutaryongyera aha kigambo eki ndikubaragiira, kandi mutarikicwaho, mubone kukwata ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebi ndikubaragiira. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Amaisho gaanyu gakeereebera ebi MUKAMA yaakozire ahabw'ebya Baali-peori; ahabw'okuba abashaija boona, abaakuratiire Baali-peori, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akabacwekyereza, yaabamara omuriimwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Kwonka imwe, abahamiire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mukiriho mwena n'eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Reeba, naabeegyesa ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye yandagiire, ngu mube nikwo mwatwaza omu nsi ei murikuza kukubuura. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:10">Zab 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:15">2 Tim 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:13">Byak 4:13</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mugume mubikwate, mubyorobere; obwo nibwo bwengye bwanyu n'okwetegyereza kwanyu omu maisho g'amahanga agarihurira ebyo biragiro byona, gakagira gati: N'ekya buzima eri ihanga rikuru n'eihanga ry'abantu b'obwengye kandi abarikwetegyereza. <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:1">Zab 46:1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:17">Efe 2:17</ref>. </char></note> Ni ihanga ki erikuru eriine ruhanga oriri haihi nka MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu oku atuba haihi, twamutakira? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kandi ni ihanga ki erikuru eriine ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe ebihikire nk'Ebiragiro ebi byona ebi naata omu maisho gaanyu eri izooba?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:23">Enf 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:7">Bir 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka oyerinde, oteho omutima orinde amagara gaawe, orekye kwebwa ebi amaisho gaawe gaareebire, bitarikuruga aha mutima ebiro byona ebi oriba okiriho; kureka obimanyise abaana baawe na baijukuru baawe. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Ogume oijukye eizooba eri waayemerereireho omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahari Horebu, obu MUKAMA yangira ati: Nteeranira abantu, mbagambire ebigambo byangye, babone kwega kuntiina ebiro byona ebi barimara omu nsi, kandi beegyese n'abaana baabo. <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Naimwe mwairira haihi, mwayemerera ahansi y'orushozi; orwo rushozi rwayaka omuriro, gwahika ahagati y'eiguru, rwashwekwa omwirima, n'ekicu, kandi omwirima ndindindi. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:12">1 Bag 19:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaabagambira naayema omu muriro; mwahurira ebyagambwa, kwonka timwagira ki mwareeba, kureka eiraka ryonka. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Yaabagambira endagaano ye, ei yaabaragiire kuhitsya, nibyo biragiro ikumi; yaabihandiika aha bishate bibiri by'amabaare. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Omu bunaku obwo MUKAMA yandagiira kubeegyesa ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe ngu mubone kubyoroberera omu nsi ei murikuza kukubuura.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 23:11">Yos 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:24-29">Byak 17:24-29</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde munonga. Nk'oku mutarareebire kishushani kyona ekya MUKAMA, obu yaabagambirira omu muriro ahari Horebu, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />mwerinde mutakaashiisha, mukeekorera ekishushani ekirikushusha ekintu kyona, ekishushani ky'ekishaija nari eky'ekikazi, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ekishushani ky'enyamaishwa yoona eri omu nsi, nari eky'ekintu kyona ekiine amapapa ekirikuguruka omu mwanya, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />ekishushani ky'ekintu kyona ekirikugyendesa enda ahansi nari eky'eky'enyanja kyona ekiri omu maizi okuzimu. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:3">Bir 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Bag 21:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mwerinde, mutakaimutsya amaisho ahaiguru, mukireeba eizooba n'okwezi n'enyonyoozi, nigo mahe goona ag'omu iguru, mukabeihwabeihwa, mukabiramya, mukabiheereza, haza biri ebintu ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaahaire amahanga goona agari ahansi y'eiguru. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Ahabw'okuba imwe nimumanya ku MUKAMA yaabakwatsire, akabashahura omu iziiko ry'ebyoma eririkubugumwamu omuriro, niyo Misri, kuba abantu be buzima, nk'oku muri na hati. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Kandi MUKAMA akangwerwa kubi ahabwanyu, yaarahira ku ntaryambuka Yorudani kuza omu nsi egyo enungi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha kuba obuhunguzi. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">2 Pet 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 1:14">14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nshemereire kufeera omu nsi egi; tinshemereire kwambuka Yorudani; kwonka imwe muryayambuka, mukubuure ensi egyo nungi. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mwerinde, mutaryebwa endagaano ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ei yaaragaine naimwe, mukeekorera ekishushani ekibaizire, ekirikushusha ekintu kyona, MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu eki yaabazibiire; <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:17">Kur 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:8">Isa 42:8</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'omuriro ogurikurya busha, Ruhanga ow'eihato.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Ku murizaara abaana, nabo baazaara abandi, mwamara omwanya muhango mutwire omu nsi egyo, bwanyima ku murishiisha, mwakora ekishushani ekibaizire, ekirikushusha ekintu kyona, mwakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu kumugwisa kubi, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:18">Bir 30:18</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 30:19">19</ref>. </char></note> eri izooba niinyeta eiguru n'ensi kuba baamushinja, kuhamya ku murihwerekyerera juba, mukahwa omu nsi ei muryambuka Yorudani kuza kukubuura; timurigimaramu mwanya muhango, kureka muryagicwekyerereramu kimwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:62">Bir 28:62</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:64">64</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:8">Neh 1:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabataataanisa, abanagye omu banyamahanga, mutsigare muri bakye omu mahanga, agu MUKAMA aribatwaramu. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:42">Byak 7:42</ref>. </char></note> Okwo muryaheererezayo baaruhanga abaakozirwe emikono y'abantu omu biti n'omu mabaare, abatarikureeba, abatarikuhurira, nari okurya, n'obu kwakuba okukaga. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:4">2 Bus 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka okwo ku murisherurirayo MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, muryamureeba, ku murimusherura n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 3:5">Hos 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:12">Yoel 2:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku origira obusaasi, ebyo byona byakuhikaho, omu biro bya bwanyima oryagarukira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, oyorobere eiraka rye; <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:9">2 Bus 30:9</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ni Ruhanga orikusaasira; tarikuhemukaho, kandi tarikucwekyereza, n'obu kwakuba okwebwa endagaano ei yaaragaine na baashwenkuru naarahira.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:8">Yob 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:31">2 Sam 22:31</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 22:32">32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obuuze eby'ebiro ebyahingwire ebyakubandiize, okwiha aha kiro eki Ruhanga yaahangiireho omuntu omu nsi, kandi n'okuruga aha muheru gw'eiguru okuhika aha gundi, ku haraabe harabaireho ekintu kyona ekikuru nk'eki, nari ku haraabe harahuriirweho ekirikushushana nakyo. <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Hariho abantu abarahuriire eiraka rya Ruhanga nirigambira omu muriro, nkaimwe oku mwarihuriire, bakagumaho bari abahuriire? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Nari shi hariho ruhanga orateireho kuza kwetwarira eihanga, naariihisa omu rindi ebigyezo n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza n'engamba n'omukono gw'amaani n'omukono ogubangire, kandi n'ebirikutiinisa munonga, nk'ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaakoreire omuri Misri byona omu maisho gaanyu oku byabaire biri? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:29">Mak 12:29</ref>. </char></note> Niiwe waayorekirwe ebyo, ngu obone kumanya ku MUKAMA ari Ruhanga; ku hatariho ondiijo kureka We wenka. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:16">Kur 24:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 24:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb 12:18</ref>. </char></note> Akeema omu iguru, yaakuhuriza eiraka rye, ngu abone kukwegyesa; n'omu nsi yaakworeka omuriro gwe omwingi; kandi waahurira ebigambo bye nibigurugamu. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kandi ahabw'okukunda baashwenkuru, nikyo yaatooraniire baijukuru baabo abaakuratsireho, akakweihira omuri Misri n'amaani ge maingi, <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />ngu abingye amahanga agarikukukiza ekitiinisa n'amaani, garugye omu maisho gaawe, akutaasye omu nsi yaabo, agikuhe kuba obuhunguzi, nk'oku kiri n'eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:11">Yos 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:8">Isa 42:8</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu eri izooba omanye eki kandi okite aha mutima, ku MUKAMA ari Ruhanga ori omu iguru ahaiguru n'omu nsi ahansi; tihariho ondiijo weena. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:31">Lev 22:31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:3">Efe 6:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ogume okwate ebiragiro bye ebyatairweho n'ebi yaaragiire, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, obone kuba gye n'abaana baawe abarikurataho, n'okuhangaarira omu nsi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha kuba eyaawe ebiro byona. <verse eid="DEU 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Bwanyima Musa yaatoorana endembo ishatu aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba seeri ya Yorudani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />ngu oriita omuntu weena ahungireyo, oriba aitsire mutaahi we, atamwitsire nkana, oshangirwe ataine buzigu nawe omu biro ebihingwire, akize amagara ge ahabw'okuhungira omu rurembo rumwe ahari ezo; <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />endembo ezo nizo ezi–Bezeeri omu ihamba eriri omu nsi y'empita ahabw'aba Reubeeni, Ramosi omuri Gileadi ahabw'aba Gaadi, na Golani omuri Bashani ahabw'aba Manaase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ebi nibyo biragiro ebi Musa yaataire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli; <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />n'ebirikuhamya, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho, n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi Musa yaagambiire Abaisraeli obu baaruga Misri, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />bakiri seeri ya Yorudani omu ruhanga orushungaine na Besi-peori, omu nsi ya Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori, owaabaire atwire Heshibooni, ou Musa n'Abaisraeli baitsire, obu baaruga Misri, <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />bakakubuura ensi ye n'eya Ogi omugabe wa Bashani, kandi abo nibo bagabe bombi b'Abaamori, abaabaire batwire seeri ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />okuruga Aroeri eri aha rubaju rw'oruhanga rwa Arunooni okuhika aha rushozi Sioni (egyo niyo Herumooni), <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />kandi na Araba yoona seeri ya Yorudani aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, n'okuhika aha nyanja ya Araba ahansi y'orushozi Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa yaayeta Abaisraeli boona, yaabagira ati: Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, muhurire ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi ndikugamba muhuriire eri izooba, mubone kubyega n'okubyorobera. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu akaragaanira naitwe endagaano ahari Horebu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:17">Mat 13:17</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe tibo MUKAMA yaaragaine nabo egyo ndagaano, kureka akaragaana naitwe abari aha, abakiriho eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />MUKAMA akagamba naimwe nimureebana, ari aha rushozi ahagati omu muriro. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:23">Zab 106:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb 12:18</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 12:19">19</ref>. </char></note> (Omu bunaku obwo nkeemerera ahagati ya MUKAMA naimwe okubagambira ekigambo kya MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba mukaba mutiinire ogwo muriro, timwainamuka ahari orwo rushozi.) Yaagira ati:<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:2-17">Kur 20:2-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku; <verse eid="DEU 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />otarigira baaruhanga abandi nyowe ndiho.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Otaryekorera ekishushani kyona ekibaizire, n'obu kyakuba ekishushani ky'ekintu kyona ekiri ahaiguru omu iguru nari ekiri omu nsi ahansi, nari ekiri omu maizi okuzimu; <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />otaribiinamira, kandi otaribiheereza; ahakuba nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ndi Ruhanga w'eihato, ntura abaana eby'okushiisha bya baishebo abarikuunyanga okuhitsya aha b'obusingye bwa kashatu n'obwa kana; <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:18">Yer 32:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:4">Dan 9:4</ref>. </char></note> kwonka abaana b'abarikunkunda bakoorobera ebiragiro byangye, mbagirira embabazi okuhitsya obusingye enkumi n'enkumi.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:12">Yak 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarizaanisa eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; ahakuba MUKAMA tarimubara nk'otaine rubanja orikuzaanisa eiziina rye.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Ijuka okweza ekiro kya sabato; nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakuragiire. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Omu biro mukaaga ogume okore; obe nimwo waakorera emirimo yaawe yoona; <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />kwonka ekiro kya mushanju niyo sabato ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; otarikoreraho omurimo gwona, iwe nari mutabani waawe, nari muhara waawe, nari omuhuuku waawe, nari omuzaana waawe, nari ente yaawe, nari endogoya yaawe, nari eki otungire kyona omu matungo gaawe, nari omunyaihanga ori omu ka yaawe; omuhuuku waawe n'omuzaana waawe bahuumure nkaiwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Kandi oryaguma oijukye ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omu nsi ya Misri, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akakwihayo n'omukono gw'amaani kandi ogubangire. Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakuragiriire kurinda sabato.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:16">Bir 27:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2">Efe 6:2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otiine sho na nyoko, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakuragiire, obone kuhangaara n'okuba gye omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yak 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi otarishambana.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />Kandi otariiba.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />Kandi otaribeiherera mutaahi waawe.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:15">Luk 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi otaryetenga omukazi wa mutaahi waawe, otaryetenga enju ya mutaahi waawe, n'obu gwakuba omusiri gwe, nari omuhuuku we, nari omuzaana we, nari ente ye, nari endogoya ye n'obu kyakuba ekintu kyona ekya mutaahi waawe.<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kur 24:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo nibyo bigambo ebi MUKAMA yaagambiire eihanga ryanyu ryona aha rushozi ruri, ari ahagati omu muriro, n'omu kicu, n'omu mwirima ndindindi, naabigamba n'eiraka rihango; tiyaagira kindi eki yaayongyeraho. Yaabihandiika aha bishate bibiri by'amabaare, yaabimpa. <verse eid="DEU 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Ku mwahuriire eiraka eririkuruga omu mwirima, mwareeba orushozi nirwaka omuriro, abeebembezi b'enganda zaanyu boona n'abakuru baanyu baanyirira haihi; <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />mwangira muti: Reeba MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaatworeka ekitiinisa kye n'obukuru bwe, kandi twahurira eiraka rye niriruga omu muriro; eri izooba twareeba Ruhanga ku arikugamba n'omuntu, akagumaho. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Mbwenu twaza kwitirwa ki? Guriya muriro mwingi ka gwaza kutumaraho. Ku turaagarukye kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, nitwija kufa. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Mbwenu n'oha omu bantu boona orahuriire eiraka rya Ruhanga otahwaho naagambira ahagati omu muriro, nk'oku twarihurira, akagumaho? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Ba niiwe wairira haihi, ohurire ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu arikugamba byona, otugambire ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu araakugambire byona; naitwe nitwija kubihurira, tubyorobere.<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />Ku mwangambiire ebigambo byanyu, MUKAMA yaabihurira; yangira ati: Mpuriire ebigambo ebi abantu abo bakugambiire; ebi bagambire byona, babigambire gye. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:29">Bir 32:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:18">Isa 48:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:20">2 Kor 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:14">Yoh 15:14</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa ku baakugira omutima nk'ogwo gukabareetera kuntiina obutoosha n'okworobera ebiragiro byangye byona, bakaaba gye, n'oruzaaro rwabo ebiro byona. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Irooko obagire oti: Mugarukye omu mahema gaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Kwonka iwe, ogume aha, ahu ndi, naanye nkugambire eki ndikuragiira kyona n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi oshemereire kubeegyesa, babone kubyoroberera omu nsi ei ndikubaha kuba eyaabo. <verse eid="DEU 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:7">Yos 1:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo muteho omutima, mukore, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abaragiire; mutariteishukira aha mukono gwa buryo nari ogwa bumosho. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:12">Bir 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:23">Yer 7:23</ref>. </char></note> Mugume mugyendere omu muhanda gwona ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahabwire, mubone kugumaho muri gye, muhangaarire omu nsi ei murikubuura.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okubeehanangiriza kworobera ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Mbwenu eki nikyo kyaragiirwe n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yandagiire kubeegyesa, ngu mubone kubyoroberera omu nsi ei murikwambukamu kukubuura; <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:13">Mub 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:1">Enf 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 3:2">2</ref>. </char></note> otiine MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, oyorobere ebiragiro bye byona ebyatairweho, ebi ndikukuragiira, iwe na mutabani waawe na mwijukuru waawe, ebiro byona ebi orimara omu nsi, haza obone kuhangaara. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo, hurira, iwe Israeli, oteho omutima, obyorobere, obone kuba gye, n'okukanyira munonga omuri egyo nsi y'amate n'obwoki, nka MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuru oku yaakuraganiise.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:6">Efe 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hurira, iwe Israeli! MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu n'omwe; <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:29-30">Mak 12:29-30</ref>. </char></note> kandi ogume okunde MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe n'omutima gwawe gwona, n'amagara gaawe goona, n'amaani gaawe goona. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Kandi ebigambo ebi, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, bishemereire kukuguma aha mutima; <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6:4</ref>. </char></note> ogume oyezirikye kubyegyesa abaana baawe, ogume obigaaniireho oshutami omu nju yaawe, nari noogyenda omu muhanda, kandi waaba nooza kubyama, kandi noimuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:21">Enf 6:21</ref>. </char></note> Obikome aha mukono gwawe, bibe akamanyiso, obite aha buso bwawe ahagati y'amaisho gaawe. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:20">Bir 11:20</ref>. </char></note> Oryabihandiika aha biti by'omuryango gw'enju yaawe n'aha nyigi z'amarembo gaawe.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:13">Yos 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku arikuhitsya omu nsi ei yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuru, Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo, yaakuha endembo mpango kandi nungi, ezi otarombekire, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />n'amaju agaijwire ebirungi byona, agu otaraijwize, n'amaziba g'amaizi agu otarafukwire, n'emisiri y'emizaabibu n'emizeituuni ei otarabyaire, waarya, waahaaga, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:17">Bir 7:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 8:11">8:11</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:4">9:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:9">15:9</ref>. </char></note> oyerinde otaryebwa MUKAMA owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Ogume otiine MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, omuheereze, n'eiziina rye obe niryo waarahira. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mutarikuratira baaruhanga abandi ab'abanyamahanga, abahereraine naimwe; <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe obari ahagati ni Ruhanga w'eihato; MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe nyentsya atarikugirira ekiniga, akakuhwerekyereza, akakwiha omu nsi.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mat 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:9">1 Kor 10:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutarigyeza MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku mwamugyereize Maasa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Mugume mwezirikye kworobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, n'ebi yaahamize, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho ebi yaabaragiire. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Kandi ogume okore ebihikire n'ebirungi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, obone kuba gye, oze omuri egyo nsi nungi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuru, ogikubuure, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />ahabw'okubinga abazigu baawe boona omu maisho gaawe, nk'oku yaagambire.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Mutabani waawe ku arikubuuza omu biro ebiriija, naagira ati: Amakuru g'ebirikuhamya n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu yaabaragiire n'enki? <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Oryamugarukamu oti: Tukaba turi abahuuku ba Faraho omuri Misri; MUKAMA yaatwiha omuri Misri n'omukono gw'amaani; <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />yaayoreka obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza eby'amaani ebirikusaasa, naabikora ahari Misri na Faraho n'eka ye yoona omu maisho gaitu; <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />yaatwihayo, ngu atureete omu nsi ei yaaraganiise baatatenkuriitwe ku arigituha. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:39">Yer 32:39</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaaturagiira kworobera ebyo biragiro byona, n'okutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, ngu tubone kuba gye ebiro byona, kandi ngu akize amagara gaitu okufa, nk'oku kiri n'eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:3">Rom 10:3</ref>. </char></note> Ku turitaho omutima, twayorobera ebyo biragiro byona omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, nk'oku yaaturagiire, kiryatubarirwa kuba okuhikiirira.<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okuragiirwa kwetaanisa n'agandi mahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku arikuhitsya omu nsi ei orikuza kukubuura, yaabinga amahanga maingi omu maisho gaawe, Abahiiti, Abagirugashi, Abaamori, Abanyakanaani, Abaperizi, Abahiivi n'Abayebusi, amahanga mushanju agarikubakira obuhango n'amaani, <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:17">Yos 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:11">11:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:32">Kur 23:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:2">Bar 2:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku ariheza kugahayo omu maisho gaawe, waagasingura, ogacwekyerereze kimwe; otarigira endagaano yoona ei waaragaana nabo, kandi otaribagirira esaasi; <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:1">1 Bag 11:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:2">Ezr 9:2</ref>. </char></note> otarishwererana nabo, kuhingira muhara waawe mutabani waabo, nari mutabani waawe kumushwererera muhara waabo; <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />ahabw'okuba baryahindura mutabani waawe arekye kunkurata, kureka aheereze baaruhanga abandi; haza kireetere MUKAMA kukugirira ekiniga, n'okurahuka kukucwekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Kwonka oku nikwo muribatwaza; muryasheenya amatambiro gaabo, musheenyagure enyomyo zaabo z'amabaare ezi baayombekire, mutemagure Ashera zaabo, kandi mwotsye ebishushani byabo ebibaizire.<verse eid="DEU 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:2">Amo 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Kor 6:19</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 6:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omanye ngu ori eihanga eryereziibwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akakutoorana omu mahanga goona agari omu nsi, kuba eihanga eri yaayetooraniire. <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Ekyareeteire MUKAMA kubakunda n'okubatoorana, ti habw'okugira ngu mukaba muri eihanga eririkukira agandi obuhango; ahakuba mukaba muri eihanga eririkukira obukye omu gandi goona; <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:3">Kur 13:3</ref>. </char></note> kureka akabatoorana ahabw'okubakunda, yaayenda ngu ahikiirize endahiro ei yaarahiire baashwenkuriimwe. Nikyo MUKAMA yaabaihiireyo n'omukono gw'amaani, akabacungura okubaiha omu nju y'obuhuuku n'omu mukono gwa Faraho omugabe wa Misri. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:9">1 Kor 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:13">10:13</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:13">2 Tim 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:9">1 Yoh 1:9</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omanye ngu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe niwe Ruhanga, Ruhanga omwesigwa, orikurinda endagaano, akagirira embabazi abarikumukunda, bakoorobera ebiragiro bye okuhitsya obusingye rukumi, <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:2">Nah 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12:19</ref>. </char></note> oihura abamwanga okubacwekyereza nibareebana; taryeganda kwihura orikumwanga, kureka aryamwihura nibareebana. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo ogume oyorobere ekiragiro kye, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Bwanyima ahabw'okuhurira ebirikuragiirwa ebyo, n'okubirinda noobyorobera, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryagumizamu ahitsye endagaano n'okukugirira embabazi, ebi yaaragaine na baashwenkuru; <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:21">Yoh 14:21</ref>. </char></note> kandi aryakukunda, akuhe omugisha, akukanyise; kandi aryaha omugisha abaana b'enda yaawe, n'ebyana by'eitaka ryawe, n'engano zaawe, na viinyo yaawe, n'amajuta gaawe g'emizeituuni, n'okukanya kw'ente zaawe n'okw'abaana b'obusyo bw'entaama zaawe omu nsi ei yaaragaine na baashwenkuru kukuha. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Oryaheebwa omugisha okukira agandi mahanga goona; tiharibaho mushaija nari omukazi oriba engumba omuriimwe, nari omu matungo gaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />MUKAMA aryakwihaho endwara zoona; kandi tarikurwaza ndwara mbi yoona aha ndwara za Misri, ezi murikumanya; kureka aryazirwaza boona abarikukwanga. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:36">Zab 106:36</ref>. </char></note> Oryacwekyereza amahanga goona, agu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arihayo ahariiwe; amaisho gaawe gatarigasaasira; kandi naimwe mutariheereza baaruhanga baabo, ahabw'okuba ekyo kiryababeera omutego.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Ku origira omu mutima gwawe oti: Amahanga aga nigankiza amaani; nimbaasa nta kuganyaga? <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:13">Bar 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:8-10">Zab 135:8-10</ref>. </char></note> Otarigatiina, kureka oijukye ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakoreire Faraho na Misri yoona, <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />ebigyezo by'amaani ebi amaisho gaawe gaareebire, obumanyiso, eby'okutangaaza, n'omukono gw'amaani kandi ogubangire, ebi MUKAMA yaakwihiiseyo; nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arigira amahanga goona agu orikutiina. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:12">Yos 24:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryayohereza enwa, zibateere, okuhitsya obu abo, abariba batsigaireho babeesherekire, baricwekyererezibwa omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:10">Yos 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:14">Neh 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Otaribatiina, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ari omuriiwe, Ruhanga omukuru kandi orikutiinisa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryabingamu ago mahanga, gakurugyeho mporampora; orekye kugamaraho ahonaaho, enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba zikakukanyaho, zikarengyesereza. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Kureka MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryagahayo omu maisho gaawe, agarabanisemu munonga, okuhitsya obu garihwerekyerera. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:9">Yos 23:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abagabe baabo aryabahayo omu mukono gwawe, naiwe oryabacwekyereza, eiziina ryabo ryebere kimwe ahansi y'eiguru; tihariho muntu weena oribaasa kukuza omu kaso, okuhitsya obu oribamariraho kimwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Yos 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:15">Luk 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 8:27">Bar 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:15">2 Bag 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:9">Rom 12:9</ref>. </char></note> Ebishushani bya baaruhanga baabo ebibaizire oryabyotsya omu muriro; otaryetenga efeeza nari ezaabu eriba ebiriho, n'obu kwakuba okugyetwarira, nyentsya okagwa omu mutego gwayo; ahabw'okuba n'ekihagaro ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Kandi otarireeta ekihagaro omu nju yaawe, okakyeenwa nkakyo; oryakyangira kimwe, okinugire kimwe, ahakuba n'ekintu ekikyeenirwe.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okubeehanangiriza okuteebwa ebi Ruhanga yaabakoreire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Ebiragiro byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, muryabitaho omutima, mubyorobere, mubone kugumaho mukakanya, mukaza omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, mukagikubuura. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:31">2 Bus 32:31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:25">Yoh 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Oryaguma oijukye omuhanda gwona ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakurabizemu omu ihamba emyaka egi yoona makumi ana, kukucwa eishaija, naakugyeza ngu amanye ebiri omu mutima gwawe, yaaba oraayorobere ebiragiro bye, nari otarikwija kubyorobera. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:40">Zab 105:40</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 105:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:3">1 Kor 10:3</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 10:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:4">Mat 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Yaakucureeza, yaakureka waagira enjara, yaakugaburira emaanu, ei waabaire otakamanyaga, n'obu baakuba baashwenkuru, ngu akumanyise ku omuntu atatungwa by'okurya byonka, kureka ku atungwa ekigambo kyona ekiruga omu kanwa ka Ruhanga. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:5">Bir 29:5</ref>. </char></note> Ebijwaro byawe tibirakukuriireho, n'ekigyere kyawe tikirazimbire, emyaka egyo yoona makumi ana. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:5">Neh 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:19">Kush 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omanye omu mutima gwawe, ku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akuhana, nk'oku omuntu ahana omwana we. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Oryakwata ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe noogyendera omu mihanda ye, noomutiina; <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe naakutwara omu nsi enungi, erimu otugyera tw'amaizi, n'enshuro n'ebiyanja by'amaizi maraingwa, agarikuhimintika nigaruga omu mpanga n'omu bibungo; <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />ensi ey'engano na sayiri n'emizaabibu n'emitiini kandi n'amakomamahanga; ensi y'amajuta g'emizeituuni n'obwoki; <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />ensi ei oriryamu eby'okurya bitatuube, kandi ei otarikyeneramu kintu kyona; ei amabaare gaayo gari obutare, kandi ei oritimba emiringa omu bibungo byayo. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:2">Zab 103:2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:18">1 Tes 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Oryarya, oigute, osiime MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahabw'ensi nungi ei akuhaire.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Oyerinde otaryebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, okanga kworobera ebiragiro bye, n'ebi yaaragiire, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho, ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 30:9">Enf 30:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriba waariire waigutsire, waayombekire enju nungi, waazitwiremu, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />amasyo gaawe g'ente n'ag'entaama ku gariba gaakanyire, efeeza n'ezaabu zaawe nazo zaakanya, n'ebi otungire byona byakanya, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:7">1 Kor 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:21">Zab 106:21</ref>. </char></note> oyerinde omutima gwawe gutaryehimbisa, okeebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku, <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:6">Yer 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:6">Kub 21:6</ref>. </char></note> akakurabya omuri eryo ihamba rihango kandi eririkutiinisa, eri waashangiremu enjoka z'obushegu oburikubabiirira na skorupio, n'ensi y'empaama etarimu maizi, owaakwihiire amaizi omu rukiri rugumire munonga; <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Rom 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:11">Heb 12:11</ref>. </char></note> owaakugabuririire emaanu omu ihamba, ei baashwenkuru baabaire batakamanyaga; ngu akucwe eishaija, akugyeze abone kukukora gye aha muheru. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:4">Bir 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:7">1 Kor 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Oyerinde otarigira omu mutima gwawe oti: Obushoboorozi bwangye n'amaani gangye nibyo byampaisize obutungi obu bwona. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:8">Hos 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Oryaguma oijukye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ahakuba niwe akubaasisa kutunga eitungo ngu abone kuhamya endagaano, ei yaaragaine na baashwenkuru naarahira, nk'oku kiri eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Kwonka ku oryebwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, waakuratira baaruhanga abandi, waabaheereza, kandi waabaramya, ninkumanyisiza kimwe eri izooba ku otaribura kuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:1-22">Tonz 1:1-22</ref>. </char></note> Nk'amahanga agu MUKAMA arikuhwerekyerereza omu maisho gaanyu, nikwo naimwe murihwerekyerera, ahabw'okwanga kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okwijutsya Abaisraeli oku baishebo baagomire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:1">Bir 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hurira, iwe Israeli! Noija kwambuka Yorudani eri izooba kunyaga amahanga agarikukukira ekitiinisa n'amaani, endembo mpango, ezeehinguririziibwe engo ezizitiire okuhika ahaiguru munonga, <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />n'abantu bahango kandi baraingwa beene Anaki, abu orikumanya, kandi abu orahuriire nibagambaho bati: N'oha orikubaasa kuza aba Anaki omu kaso? <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:3">Bir 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:24">7:24</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 Tes 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Eri izooba omanye ngu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe niwe ogwo oraayambukye, akwebembeire nk'omuriro gurikurya busha; niwe araabacwekyereze, akabagomoorera omu maisho gaawe; naiwe oryababingamu, obahwerekyereze ahonaaho, nk'oku MUKAMA yaakugambiire.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:32">Ezk 36:32</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:6">Rom 11:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:4">1 Kor 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:12">Bir 18:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA Ruhanga ku ariheza kubabinga, baakuruga omu maisho, otarigira omu mutima gwawe oti: MUKAMA andeetsire omu nsi egi kugikubuura ahabw'okuhikiirira kwangye; haza kunu MUKAMA abingire ago mahanga omu maisho gaanyu ahabw'obubi bwago. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:9">2 Tim 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:32">Byak 13:32</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Torikuza omu nsi yaabo kugikubuura ahabw'okuhikiirira kwawe nari okugororoka kw'omutima gwawe, kureka ahabw'obubi bw'ago mahanga nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikubabingira omu maisho gaawe, kandi ngu abone kuhamya ekigambo eki yaarahiire naaraganisa baashwenkuru, Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo omanye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku atarikukuha nsi egi kugikubuura ahabw'okuhikiirira kwawe; ahabw'okuba ori eihanga ery'ebitsya bigangaire. <verse eid="DEU 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:11">Kur 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:2">16:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:2">17:2</ref>. </char></note> Oijukye, kandi oteebwa oku waitsize MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ekiniga omu ihamba; okwiha aha izooba eri waarugiireho omu nsi ya Misri, n'okuhitsya obu muhikire aha, mukaba mugomera MUKAMA. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Kur 32:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'ahari Horebu mukaitsizaho MUKAMA ekiniga, yaabagirira ekiniga, yaayenda kubacwekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Ku nainamukire aha rushozi kwakiira ebishate biri eby'amabaare, nibyo bishate by'endagaano ei MUKAMA yaaragaine naimwe, naamara ahari orwo rushozi ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro; nkaba ntarya kintu kyona, n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />MUKAMA yampa ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare ebihandiikirweho orukumu rwa Ruhanga; bikaba biriho ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA agambiire naimwe ahari orwo rushozi, ari ahagati omu muriro, aha izooba ry'okuteeraniraho. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Ebyo biro makumi ana ku byahweire, MUKAMA yampa ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare, nibyo bishate by'endagaano; <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:7">Kur 32:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:9">9</ref>. </char></note> yangira ati: Imuka, orugye aha, orahukye oshuume; ahabw'okuba abantu baawe abu waihire Misri, beesiisire; baarahuka kuteishuka omuhanda, ogu naabaragiire kutoora; baayeheeshera ekishushani.<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Kandi MUKAMA yangira ati: Ndeebire eihanga eri, reeba n'eihanga ry'ebitsya bigangaire; <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10">Kur 32:10</ref>. </char></note> reka mbacwekyereze, eiziina ryabo ryebere kimwe ahansi y'eiguru, nkuhindure eihanga eririkubakiza amaani n'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Naanye naahinduka, naaruga aha rushozi, kandi orwo rushozi rukaba nirwaka omuriro; ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare nkaba mbiine omu ngaro zombi. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ku naayetegyereize, naareeba mucumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mweheesheire ekishushani ky'enyana omu zaabu, muteishukire omuhanda ogu MUKAMA yaabaire abaragiire kutoora. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Naakwata ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare, ebyabaire bindi omu ngaro zombi, naabiteera ahansi, naabyatira omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:23">Zab 106:23</ref>. </char></note> Naagwa ahansi omu maisho ga MUKAMA nk'okubanza, okumara ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro; tinaarya kintu kyona, n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi, ahabw'ekibi kyanyu kyona eki mwakozire, nimukora ekirikwangwa MUKAMA, kumwitsa ekiniga. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:10">Kur 32:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:23">Zab 106:23</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:1-6">Amo 7:1-6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nkatiina ahabw'ekiniga n'okubiihirwa kwingi, ebi MUKAMA yaabagiriire, akenda kubacwekyereza. Kwonka omuri obwo bunaku nabwo MUKAMA yampurira. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Kandi MUKAMA yaagirira Arooni ekiniga kingi, yaayenda kumwita; omuri obwo bunaku na Arooni nawe naamushabira. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:20">Kur 32:20</ref>. </char></note> Naakwata ekibi kyanyu, nikyo kishushani ky'enyana eki mwaheesire, naakyotsya omu muriro, naakihondahonda, naakisa, naakicwa obunono; esaano yaakyo naaginaga omu kagyera, akaabaire nikaruga omu rushozi.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Kandi n'ahari Tabera na Maasa na Kibiroosi-hatava mukaitsa MUKAMA ekiniga. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:3">Kur 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:1">14:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:18">Heb 3:18</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 3:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:2">4:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'obu MUKAMA yaabatumira Kadeshi-barunea, naagira ati: Mwinamukye, mukubuure ensi ei mbahaire; nabwo mukagomera ekiragiro kya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, timwamwikiriza, n'obu kwakuba okumuhurira. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Mukaba mugomera MUKAMA, okwiha aha izooba eri naatandikiireho kubamanya.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Ntyo naajuumara ahansi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, okumara ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro, ahakuba MUKAMA akagamba ku arikwija kubacwekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11">Kur 32:11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:29">Enf 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:1">Yer 15:1</ref>. </char></note> Naashaba MUKAMA nti: Ai Mukama RUHANGA, otacwekyereza abantu baawe, nibwo buhunguzi bwawe, abu waacungwize ekitiinisa kyawe, okabaiha omuri Misri n'omukono gw'amaani. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Ijuka abairu baawe Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo; oteeta aha bugangaazi bw'aba bantu, nari aha bubi bwabo n'ekibi kyabo; <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:57">Kut 41:57</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:16">Kub 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:7-9">Yos 7:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:1">Zab 115:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 115:2">2</ref>. </char></note> abantu b'omu nsi ei waatwihiremu batakaagira ngu: MUKAMA akaremwa kubahitsya omu nsi ei yaabaraganiise, kandi ngu, ahabw'okubanga, akabaihayo kubaitira omu ihamba. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:10">Neh 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:7">Zab 95:7</ref>. </char></note> Haza kunu bari abantu baawe, kandi obuhunguzi bwawe, abu waihireyo n'omukono gwawe ogw'amaani kandi ogubangire.<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugaruka kubaha ebindi bishate by'amabaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:1">Kur 34:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku obwo MUKAMA akangambira ati: Baija ebishate bibiri by'amabaare ebirikushusha eby'okubanza, oinamukye, onshangye aha rushozi, kandi obaije n'eshanduukye y'ekiti; <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />naanye niinyija kuhandiika ahari ebyo bishate ebigambo ebyabaire biri aha bishate by'okubanza, ebi waayatsire, obite omuri egyo shanduukye. <verse eid="DEU 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Ntyo naabaija eshanduukye y'omunyinya, n'ebishate bibiri by'amabaare ebirikushusha eby'okubanza, nainamuka aha rushozi, nyine ebyo bishate byombi omu ngaro. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>. </char></note> Yaabihandiikaho ebiragiro ikumi, nk'oku yaahandiikire aha by'okubanza, ebi MUKAMA yaabagambiriire aha rushozi ari ahagati omu muriro aha izooba eri mwateeraniireho; MUKAMA yaabimpa. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:20">Kur 40:20</ref>. </char></note> Naahinduka, naashuuma okuruga ahari orwo rushozi, naabita omu shanduukye ei naabaizire; kandi nimwo biri, nk'oku MUKAMA yandagiire.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 10:5">(<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Abaisraeli bakaimutsya orugyendo okuruga Beeroosi-beene-yakani, baaza Mosera; okwo niyo Arooni yaagwire, kandi niyo yaaziikirwe; Eleazaari omutabani yaakora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Okuruga aho baimutsya orugyendo, baaza Gudigoda; baaruga Gudigoda, baaza Yotibaasa, ensi y'otugyera tw'amaizi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:5">Bir 21:5</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo nimwo MUKAMA yaashorooreire oruganda rwa Leevi kuguma nibaheeka eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, n'okwemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA nibamuheereza, kandi n'okushabira abantu omugisha omu iziina rye, nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Nikyo Abaleevi batagirira mugabo n'obu bwakuba obuhunguzi omuri beene waabo; MUKAMA niwe buhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaabagambiire.)<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Naaguma ahari orwo rushozi okumara ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro, nk'okubanza; obwo nabwo MUKAMA yampurira, tiyaayenda kubacwekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Imuka ogyende, oyebembere abo bantu, baze omu nsi ei naarahiire kuha baishenkurubo, bagikubuure. <verse eid="DEU 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mik 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:37">Mat 22:37</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu Israeli, ekindi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe naakwenza ki? T'okutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, okugyendera omu mihanda ye yoona, okumukunda, okumuheereza n'omutima gwawe gwona n'amagara gaawe goona, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />n'okukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebi yaataireho, ebi ndikukuragiira hati ngu obe gye? <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:16">Zab 115:16</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, eiguru, n'eiguru eriri ahaiguru y'agandi, n'ensi n'ebirimu byona n'ebya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, MUKAMA akata omutima ahari baashwenkuru, yaabakunda okukira agandi mahanga goona, yaatoorana oruzaaro rwabo orwakuratsireho, nibo imwe nk'oku kiri na hati. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:28">Rom 2:28</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:11">Kol 2:11</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mushare ekishushu eky'aha mitima yaanyu, murekye kugaruka kuba ab'ebitsya bigangaire. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:47">Dan 2:47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:7">2 Bus 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ni Ruhanga wa baaruhanga, kandi MUKAMA w'abakama, Ruhanga omukuru ow'amaani kandi orikutiinisa, otashoroora mu bantu, kandi otarya nguzi, <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:5">Zab 68:5</ref>. </char></note> ocwera efuuzi n'abafaakazi emanja z'oburyo, kandi okunda omunyaihanga, akamuha eby'okurya n'eby'okujwara. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo mukunde abanyamahanga, ahakuba naimwe mukaba muri abanyaihanga omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:11">Zab 63:11</ref>. </char></note> Oryaguma otiine MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; obe niwe waaheereza, omuhamireho, kandi eiziina rye obe niryo waarahira. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Niwe kwesiima kwawe kandi Ruhanga waawe, owaakukoreire ebikuru biri kandi ebirikutiinisa, ebi waayereebeire. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Baashwenkuru bakashuuma Misri, bari abantu makumi mushanju; mbwenu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe abagizire baingi nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli oku bashemereire kukunda Ruhanga n'okumworobera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo oryaguma okunde MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, orinde obutoosha ebi yaakukwatsize, n'ebyatairweho, n'ebyaragiirwe, n'ebiragiro bye. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Eri izooba mumanye ebi, (ahakuba tindikugambira baana baanyu, abatakabimanyire n'obu kwakuba okubireeba), muteekateekye aha kuhana kwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, obukuru bwe, omukono gwe gw'amaani kandi ogubangire, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />obumanyiso bwe n'ebi yaakozire Faraho omugabe wa Misri n'ensi ye yoona omu nsi ya Misri; <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />n'ebi yaakozire eihe rya Misri n'embaraasi zaabo n'ebigaari byabo; oku yaagarwire amaizi g'Enyanja erikutukura, gakabashweka babakuratiire, MUKAMA akabacwekyerereza kimwe, batagarukye kwimutsya omutwe n'okuhitsya hati; <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />n'ebi yaabakozire muri omu ihamba, okuhitsya obu mwahikire aha; <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1">Kub 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:17">Zab 106:17</ref>. </char></note> n'ebi yaakozire Dasani na Abiraamu beene Eliabu, mutabani wa Reubeeni, oku eitaka ryayashamire, rikabamira n'ab'omu maka gaabo n'amahema gaabo n'ebintu byona ebihuriire ebi baabaire nibagyenda nabyo, bikacwekyererera ahagati y'Abaisraeli boona; <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />ahakuba amaisho gaanyu gakeereebera ebikuru byona ebi MUKAMA yaakozire.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Nikyo mushemerereire kukwata ebiragiro byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, mubone kuba ab'amaani, muze omu nsi ei murikuza kwambukamu kukubuura, ku eba eyaanyu, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />kandi mubone kuhangaarira omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe n'oruzaaro rwabo, ensi ey'amate n'obwoki. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Ahakuba ensi ei murikuzamu kukubuura ti nk'eya Misri ei mwarugiremu, ei mwabaire mubiba embibo, mukareetamu amaizi n'ebigyere byanyu, nk'oku bagira omusiri gw'emboga; <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:7">Bir 8:7</ref>. </char></note> kureka ensi, ei murikuzamu kukubuura, n'ensi y'ebibungo n'empanga erikuguubwamu amaizi g'enjura erikuruga omu iguru, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />n'ensi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikutaho omutima; kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu atuura agitaireho amaisho, okwiha aha kutandika kw'omwaka okuhitsya aha muheru gwagwo.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Ku muryezirika kworobera ebiragiro byangye, ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, n'okumuheereza n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:12">Bir 28:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:23">Yoel 2:23</ref>. </char></note> naanye ndyagwisiza ensi yaanyu enjura omu bunaku bwayo, ey'eibiba n'eya katumba, mubone kushaaruura engano zaanyu, na viinyo yaanyu n'amajuta gaanyu g'emizeituuni. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:14">Zab 104:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndyameza obunyaatsi omu mariisizo gaanyu ahabw'amatungo gaanyu, murye, mwigute. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mwerinde, emitima yaanyu etaribeihwa-beihwa, mukateishuka, mukaheereza baaruhanga abandi, mukabaramya, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:26">2 Bus 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:13">7:13</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akabagirira ekiniga kingi, akakinga eiguru, enjura ekabura, ensi ekareka kweza emyaka yaayo, mukarahuka kuhwerekyerera, mukahwa omu nsi enungi ei MUKAMA arikubaha.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />N'ahabw'ekyo mute ebigambo byangye ebi aha mitima yaanyu n'omu magara gaanyu, mubikome aha mikono yaanyu, bibe akamanyiso, mubite aha buso bwanyu ahagati y'amaisho gaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:6">Enf 22:6</ref>. </char></note> Mugume mubyegyese abaana baanyu, mubigaaniireho mushutami omu maka gaanyu, nimugyenda omu muhanda, nimuza kubyama, kandi nimwimuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Muryabihandiika aha biti by'emiryango y'amaju gaanyu n'aha nyigi z'amarembo gaanyu; <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:2">Enf 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 4:10">4:10</ref>. </char></note> ebiro byanyu n'eby'abaana baanyu bibone kukanya omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe omwanya gwona ogu eiguru ririmara riri ahaiguru y'ensi. <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Ahakuba ku muryezirika kukwata ebiragiro ebi byona ebi ndikubaragiira, mwabyorobera, okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, n'okugyendera omu mihanda ye yoona, n'okumuhamiraho, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:38">Bir 4:38</ref>. </char></note> obwo MUKAMA aryabinga amahanga ago goona omu maisho gaanyu, kandi muryakubuura amahanga agarikubakira obukuru n'amaani. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:3">Yos 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Omwanya gwona ogu muriribatamu n'ebigyere byanyu guryaba ogwanyu; omwatano gwanyu guryatandikira aha ihamba na Lebanooni, n'aha mugyera Furaati, guhikye aha Nyanja y'oburengyerwa-izooba. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Bir 7:24</ref>. </char></note> Tihaine muntu weena oribaasa kubaza omu kaso; MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryaitsa obwoba ensi yoona ei muriribatamu, kandi agireetere okutiina ahabwanyu, nk'oku yaabaraganiise.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 30:1">Bir 30:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, eri izooba ninta omu maisho gaanyu omugisha n'omukyeeno; <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:2">Bir 28:2</ref>. </char></note> omugisha ku muryorobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>. </char></note> n'omukyeeno ku muryanga kworobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mwateishuka omuhanda ogu ndikubaragiira eri izooba, mwakuratira baaruhanga abandi, abu mutakamanyaga. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:33">Yos 8:33</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ku aribahitsya omu nsi, ei murikuza kukubuura, muryata omugisha aha rushozi Gerizimu n'omukyeeno aha rushozi Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Enshozi ezo tiziri seeri ya Yorudani, oburengyerwa-izooba bw'omuhanda omu nsi y'Abanyakanaani, abatwire omuri Araba, ahashungaine na Gilugaali, aha rubaju rw'emyela ya Moore? <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Ahakuba nimwija kwambuka Yorudani kuza omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kukubuura, kandi kwo muryagikubuura, mugituuremu. <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />Kandi muryaguma mute omutima aha biragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe byona, ebi ndikuta omu maisho gaanyu eri izooba, mubyorobere.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okugira Omwanya ogurikwera gumwe gwonka ogw'okuramizamu Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi nibyo biragiro ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, ebi mushemereire kutaho omutima, mukabyorobera muri omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe yaabahaire kukubuura, ebiro byona ebi murimara omu nsi. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Mutaribura kusheenya emyanya yoona, ei amahanga, agu murikwija kunyaga, gaabaire gaheererezamu baaruhanga baago, ey'aha nshozi ndaingwa, n'aha bibungo, n'ey'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi; <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:4">Zab 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:2">Zek 13:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi muryasheenya amatambiro gaabo, musheenyagure enyomyo zaabo z'amabaare ezi baayombekire, mwotsye Ashera zaabo n'omuriro, mutemagure ebishushani bya baaruhanga baabo ebibaizire; mumareho eiziina ryabo omu mwanya ogwo.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Kwonka imwe tikwo murigirira MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:12">2 Bus 7:12</ref>. </char></note> kureka muryasherura omwanya, ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aritoorana omu nganda zaanyu zoona, kuba nigwo yaatamu eiziina rye, akagugira Obutaaho bwe; <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />okwo niyo muriguma nimuza, kandi okwo niyo muriguma nimureeta ebitambo byanyu eby'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, na kimwe kya ikumi kyanyu, n'empongano ezi muhonga, n'ebi muhayo ahabw'okuhiga, n'ebi muhayo mweyendeire, n'emijigaijo y'amasyo gaanyu g'ente n'ag'entaama; <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:12">Mub 3:12</ref>. </char></note> okwo niyo muririira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, niyo imwe n'ab'omu maka gaanyu murishemerererwa ekintu kyona eki muritaho engaro, eki MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ariba abaheereiremu omugisha. <verse eid="DEU 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Mutarikora nk'ebi byona ebi turikukora omu bunaku obu, obu buri muntu arikukora eki arikusiima; <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />ahabw'okuba timukahikire h'okuhuumurira n'omu buhunguzi, obu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha.<verse eid="DEU 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Kwonka ku muryambuka Yorudani, mwatuura omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuhungura, yaabahuumuza engamba z'abazigu baanyu boona abariba babeehinguririize, ngu mubone kugituuramu buhooro, <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yos 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:68">Zab 78:68</ref>. </char></note> obwo muryaguma nimureeta ebi ndikubaragiira byona omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye, ebitambo byanyu eby'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, na kimwe kya ikumi kyanyu, n'empongano ezi muhonga n'ebi muritoorana kuragaanisa kuhayo ahari MUKAMA; <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />kandi muryayesiimira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, imwe n'abatabani baanyu na bahara baanyu n'abahuuku baanyu n'abazaana baanyu, n'Abaleevi abari omu maka gaanyu, ahakuba tibaine mugabo n'obu bwakuba obuhunguzi omuriimwe. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:4">Lev 17:4</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde mutaritambira ebitambo byanyu ahu murishanga hoona; <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />kureka omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana omuri rumwe aha nganda zaanyu, mube nimwo mwatambira ebitambo byanyu by'okwotsya, kandi mube nimwo mwakorera ebi ndikubaragiira byona. <verse eid="DEU 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kwonka nimwikirizibwa kwita enyamaishwa n'okurya enyama yaazo, nk'oku murikwenda, omu maka gaanyu goona, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ariba abahaire omugisha; abatashemeire n'abashemeire boona nibaikirizibwa kugiryaho, nk'oku barya esirabo n'empara. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Kut 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:20">Byak 15:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mutarirya eshagama, kureka muryagyata ahansi nk'amaizi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Kandi kimwe kya ikumi ky'engano zaanyu n'ekya viinyo yaanyu n'eky'amajuta gaanyu g'emizeituuni, n'emijigaijo y'amasyo gaanyu g'ente n'ag'entaama, n'ekintu kyona eki mwaraganiise kuhayo, n'eki murihayo n'omutima ogweyendeire, n'empongano ezi murihonga, ebyo byona mutaribiriira omu maka gaanyu; <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:12">Mub 3:12</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 3:13">13</ref>. </char></note> kureka muryabiriira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omu mwanya ogu aritoorana, imwe n'abatabani baanyu na bahara baanyu n'abahuuku baanyu n'abazaana baanyu n'Abaleevi abari omu maka gaanyu; kandi muryayesiimira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omuri byona ebi muritaho engaro. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Mwerinde mutaryebwa Omuleevi ebiro byona ebi murimara omu nsi yaanyu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku arihangusya ensi yaawe nk'oku yaakuraganiise, waagira oti: Niinyenda kurya enyama, ahakuba amagara gangye niyo gakunda; oryaikirizibwa kurya enyama nk'oku orikwenda. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Omwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba atooraine kugumyamu eiziina rye, ku guriba gukuri hare, oryaita omu masyo gaawe g'ente n'ag'entaama, agu MUKAMA yaakuhaire, nk'oku naakuragiire; oryariira omu ka yaawe, nk'oku orikwenda kwona. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Nk'oku barya esirabo n'empara, nikwo orirya egyo nyama; abatashemeire n'abashemeire boona nibaikirizibwa kugirya. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Kwonka eki oryerinda, n'okurya eshagama; ahakuba eshagama n'amagara; n'ahabw'ekyo otarirya enyama n'amagara gaayo. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Otarigirya, kureka oryagyata ahansi nk'amaizi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:38">1 Bag 11:38</ref>. </char></note> Otarigirya, obone kuba gye, hamwe n'abaana baawe abarikurataho, ku oriba waakozire ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Kwonka ebintu byanyu ebirikwera, ebi oshemereire kuhonga, n'empongano zaawe z'ebi oragaanisa noohiga, oryabitwara, oze omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana, <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />otambire ebitambo byawe eby'okwotsya, enyama n'eshagama, aha itambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; eshagama y'ebitambo byawe eryashukwa aha itambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, reero enyama ogirye. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:1-4">Enf 3:1-4</ref>. </char></note> Ogume oteho omutima kuhurira ebigambo ebi byona, ebi ndikukuragiira, obone kuba gye ebiro byona hamwe n'abaana baawe abarikurataho, ku oriba waakozire ebirungi kandi ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:55">Zab 78:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku arihwerekyereza amahanga omu maisho gaawe omu nsi ei orikuza kukubuura, waagikubuura, waagituuramu, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />oyerinde otaritegwa kugakuratira, gaherize kuhwerekyerezibwa omu maisho gaawe, okabuuririza ebya baaruhanga baabo noogira oti: Amahanga aga gakaba gaheereza gata baaruhanga baago? Naanye nkabona kutwaza ntyo. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:3">Lev 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:30">26:30</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:15">2 Bag 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:35">Yer 32:35</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka iwe tikwo origirira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; ahakuba bo bakaba bakorera baaruhanga baabo buri kintu kyona ekirikunugwa eki MUKAMA ayanga; nangwa n'abatabani baabo na bahara baabo nabo babookyeza baaruhanga baabo omu muriro. <verse eid="DEU 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:7">Yos 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 30:6">Enf 30:6</ref>. </char></note> Eki ndikubaragiira kyona, nikyo mushemereire kutaho omutima kukora; mutarikyongyeraho, kandi mutarikicwaho.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya baanabi b'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:9">2 Tes 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuriimwe ku hariimukamu nabi nari omurootsi w'ebirooto, yaabakorera akamanyiso nari eky'okutangaaza, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:9">Yer 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:22">Mat 7:22</ref>. </char></note> kandi ako kamanyiso nari eky'okutangaaza ekyo eki abagagambiireho kyahikiirira, yagaruka yaagira ati: Ka tukuratire baaruhanga abandi abu mutakamanyaga, tubaheereze; <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:19">1 Kor 11:19</ref>. </char></note> mutarihurira ebigambo bya nabi ogwo nari eby'ogwo murootsi w'ebirooto; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryaba naabagyeza, kumanya ku muraabe nimukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:31">2 Bus 34:31</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:6">2 Yoh 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Muryaguma mukuratire MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mumutiine, mukwate ebiragiro bye, muhurire eiraka rye, mumuheereze, kandi mumuhamireho. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:15">Yer 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 10:18-28">2 Bag 10:18-28</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nabi ogwo, nari ogwo murootsi w'ebirooto, aryaitwa, ahabw'okubagambira eby'okugomera MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri, akabacungura omu nju y'obuhuuku, n'ahabw'okubateishura omuhanda ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaragiire kugyenderamu. Ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekibi omuriimwe.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Murumuna waawe, omwana wa nyoko, nari mutabani waawe, nari muhara waawe, nari omukazi waawe ow'aha mukono, nari munywani waawe ow'aha mara, ku arikwosyosya omu mubonano naagira ati: Ija, tuze kuheereza baaruhanga abandi, abu otakamanyaga, n'obu baakuba baashwenkuru, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />baaruhanga b'amahanga agabeehinguririize, agari haihi naimwe, nari agabari hare, okuruga aha muheru gw'ensi, okuhika aha gundi; <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:10">Enf 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:8">Gal 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 1:9">9</ref>. </char></note> otarimwikiriza n'obu kwakuba okumuhurira; otarimureebesa eriisho ry'esaasi, otarimusaasira, kandi otarimushereka, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">Bir 17:7</ref>. </char></note> kureka buzimazima oryamwita; omukono gwawe gube nigwo gwamubanza, bwanyima hateho ey'abandi boona; <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />oryamuteera amabaare, afe, ahabw'okuba ayenzire kukubeihabeiha, ngu akwihe ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, owaakwihire omu nsi ya Misri, omu nju y'obuhuuku. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Kandi Abaisraeli boona baryakihurira, batiine, tibarigaruka kukora kibi ekirikwingana kityo omuriimwe.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 22:11">Yos 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku orihurira amakuru ahari rumwe aha ndembo zaawe, ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakuhaire kutuuramu, ngu, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:15">2 Kor 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:19">1 Yoh 2:19</ref>. </char></note> hariho abantu babi abarugire omuriimwe, bakoosyosya abatwire omu rurembo rwabo, nibagira bati: Ka tugyende tuheereze baaruhanga abandi, abu mutakamanyaga; <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />obibuuririze, obikuratirire, obicondooze; ku orishanga biri eby'amazima bitarikubanganisibwa, ku ekihagaro ekirikushusha kityo kikoreirwe omuriimwe, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />otaribura kwitsa ab'omuri orwo rurembo rurara, okarucwekyerereza kimwe n'ebirimu byona hamwe n'amatungo gaamwo. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Eminyago yaamwo yoona oryagirunda ahu emihanda erikuteeranira, oyotsye orwo rurembo n'eminyago yaamwo yoona, nk'oku bootsya ekitambo eky'okwokyeza kimwe ekitambiirwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; orwo rurembo ruryaguma ruri omutuumo ebiro byona; tiruryombekwa bundi. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:18">Yos 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:1">7:1</ref>. </char></note> Otarigira ekintu kyona eki waagumya omu ngaro ahari ebyo ebyashorooreirwe MUKAMA, abone kureka ekiniga kye kingi, akugirire embabazi n'esaasi, akukanyise, nk'oku yaaraganiise baashwenkuru naarahira; <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />ku origuma noohurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, nookwata ebiragiro bye byona, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, nookora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okurya ebirikuzira, n'ebitarikuzira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 3:1">1 Yoh 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 41:5">Yer 41:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muri abaana ba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; mutaryesharashara n'obu kwakuba okwemwa omu buso, nari okumwa bahungu ahabw'okuba omu rufu. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:12">Isa 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba muri eihanga eryereziibwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, kandi MUKAMA akabatoorana omu mahanga goona ag'omu nsi kuba eihanga rye, eri yaayetooraniire. <verse eid="DEU 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:13">Byak 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:14">Rom 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Otarirya ekintu kyona ekirikuzira. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:2">Lev 11:2</ref>. </char></note> Ezi nizo nyamaishwa ezi murikwikirizibwa kurya-ente, entaama, embuzi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />empara, esirabo, esa, enkorongo, enyemera, n'ekihondamabaare. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Omu nyamaishwa zoona buri nyamaishwa eyatsizemu ebyara, eine ebigyere by'ebyara bibiri, kandi erikwekuuma, mube niyo mwaguma nimurya. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Kwonka omuri ezo ezirikwekuuma, nari ezaatsizemu ebyara, ezi mutarizirya; engamira, orumi n'endirira ahabw'okuba zeekuuma, kwonka tizaatsizemu byara; zibe ezirikuzira ahariimwe; <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />kandi empunu, ahabw'okuba eyatsizemu ebyara, kwonka teyekuuma; ahariimwe nikizira; mutarirya enyama yaazo, n'obu kwakuba okukora aha mitumbi yaazo.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Ahari byona eby'omu maizi ebi nibyo murikwikirizibwa kurya; ebiine amapapa n'engamba, mube nibyo mwarya; <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />ekitaine mapapa na ngamba mutarikirya; ahariimwe nikizira. <verse eid="DEU 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Enyonyi zoona ezitarikuzira nimwikirizibwa kuzirya. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Kwonka ezi nizo mutarikwikirizibwa kurya–eishamba, empungumareere, kaamushungu-shungu, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />ekyanira, nyakabaka n'oruganda rwayo, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />ekikoona kyona n'oruganda rwakyo, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />maaya, ekishoma-bwire, enyangi, akaca n'oruganda rwako, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />ekihihizi ekikye n'ekihango, enyawaawa, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />nyamunyonyi, ekihuhura-bahuta, ekiyoyo, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />enkongoro, oruyongoyongo n'oruganda rwarwo, enkooherwa, n'orubaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Ebikooko byona ebiine amapapa, ebirikugyendesa amaguru ahariimwe nikizira; mutaribirya; <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />kureka enyonyi zoona ezitarikuzira nizo murikwikirizibwa kurya.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Mutarirya ekintu kyona ekyefeereire; nimwikirizibwa kukiha omunyaihanga otwire naimwe, akirye; nari shi nimwikirizibwa kukiguza omunyaihanga; ahakuba muri eihanga eryereziibwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Mutariteeka omwana gw'embuzi omu mahenehene ga nyinagwo.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 10:37">Neh 10:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaribura kuha kimwe kya ikumi eky'ebi oyeza omu misiri yaawe buri mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Kandi oryaguma oriire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, omu mwanya ogu aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye, kimwe kya ikumi ky'engano zaawe, n'ekya viinyo yaawe n'eky'amajuta gaawe g'emizeituuni, n'emijigaijo y'amasyo gaawe g'ente n'ag'entaama, obone kwega kuguma nootiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Obundi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku ariheza kukuha omugisha, orugyendo ruryakubeera ruraingwa, oremwe kukitwarayo ahabw'omwanya kukuba hare ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba atooraine kugumyamu eiziina rye. <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />Ku kiriba kyabaire kityo, oryabiihamu efeeza, ozizingirire, ozitware omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba atooraine; <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />oziguremu ebi orikwenda byona, yaaba nte, nari entaama, nari viinyo, nari eky'okunywa eky'amaani, nari ekindi kyona eki omutima gwawe gurikwenda; obiriire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe n'ab'omu ka yaawe boona, mushemererwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:1-14">1 Kor 9:1-14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'Omuleevi otwire naiwe otarimwebwa, ahabw'okuba taine mugabo n'obu bwakuba obuhunguzi omuriimwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:4">Amo 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Aha muheru gwa buri myaka eshatu oryaiha aha bi oyerize omuri ogwo mwaka kimwe kya ikumi, okibiikye omu ka yaawe; <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:18">Bir 10:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:7-12">Isa 58:7-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:6-11">2 Kor 9:6-11</ref>. </char></note> reero Omuleevi ahabw'okutagira mugabo n'obu bwakuba obuhunguzi omuriimwe, n'omunyaihanga, n'efuuzi, n'omufaakazi, abatwire naiwe, nabo baije, barye, bahaagye, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe abone kukuha omugisha omu mirimo yoona ei oriba nookora n'emikono yaawe.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Omwaka gwa mushanju ogw'obusingye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 34:14">Yer 34:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha muheru gwa buri myaka mushanju oryaha abantu obusingye. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Ogu nigwo muringo ogu murihamu obusingye; buri muntu weena oriba aine ou arikwihuza, aryareka ekyo eki yaagurize mutaahi we; atarikiihuza mutaahi we nari mwene ishe; ahabw'okuba okuha obusingye, okuragiirwe MUKAMA, kuherize kurangwa. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:20">Bir 23:20</ref>. </char></note> Noikirizibwa kwihuza omunyaihanga; kwonka ekintu kyawe kyona ekiinwe mwene waanyu, oryakimurekyera. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:8">Bir 28:8</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku orihurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, waataho omutima kworobera ebiragiro ebyo byona ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />tiharibaho booro omuriimwe; ahakuba MUKAMA taribura kukuha omugisha omu nsi ei MUKAMA arikukuha kukubuura kuba obuhunguzi; <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryakuha omugisha, nk'oku yaakuraganiise; oryaguza amahanga maingi, kwonka iwe torigeeguzaho; oryategyeka amahanga maingi, kwonka go tigarikutegyeka.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:30">Mat 18:30</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:17">1 Yoh 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haribaho omworo omuri beene waanyu omu ka emwe aha maka gaanyu omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha, otarigangaaza omutima, okaba engumya ahari mwene waanyu omworo; <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:42">Mat 5:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:34">Luk 6:34</ref>. </char></note> kureka omushashaanurire engaro, omuguze ekirikubaasa kumumarira obukyene bw'ekyo eki akyenire. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 34:28">Yob 34:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Zab 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Oyerinde otarigira ekiteekateeko ky'obufura bukye omu mutima gwawe, okagira oti: Omwaka gwa mushanju ogw'okuha obusingye guri haihi; okareeba mwene waanyu eriisho ribi, okanga kugira eki waamuha, nawe akatakira MUKAMA naakutabaariza, haza kikakurugiramu ekibi. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:40">Mat 25:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:35">Byak 20:35</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:5-11">2 Kor 9:5-11</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:18">1 Tim 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 11:24">Enf 11:24</ref>. </char></note> Otaribura kumuha; kandi ku orimuha, otaritsigara noonyomwa omu mutima; ahabw'okuba ahabw'ekigambo ekyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryakuha omugisha omu mirimo yaawe yoona n'omuri byona ebi orikora n'emikono yaawe. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Mumanye ngu abooro tibarihwa mu nsi; nikyo ndikukuragiirira nti: Otaribura kushashaanurira mwene waanyu engaro, omukyene n'omworo abari omu nsi yaawe. <verse eid="DEU 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Ku barikuguza mwene waanyu Omuheburaayo nari Omuheburaayokazi, akukorere emyaka mukaaga; omu gwa mushanju omurekure, agyende n'obusingye. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Kandi ku orimurekura, otarimureka, akagyenda engaro nsha; <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:22">Enf 10:22</ref>. </char></note> kureka oryamuha aha bi otungire omu masyo gaawe, n'eby'aha mbuga yaawe, n'omu inyuukiro ryawe otarikunyomwa; nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba akuhaire omugisha, naiwe nikwo orimuha. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Oryaijuka naiwe ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omu nsi ya Misri, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akakucungura; nikyo ndikukuragiirira eki eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:5">Kur 21:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 21:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku arikugambira ahabw'okukukunda n'eka yaawe, kandi n'okuba gye naiwe, ati: Tindikwija kukurugaho, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />oryareeta empindu, ogimufumuze okutu, eyogyemu, ekwate orwigi; obwo aryaguma ari omuhuuku waawe ebiro byona. Kandi n'omuzaana waawe nikwo orimutwaza otyo. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Ku orimurekura yaakurugaho n'obusingye, otaritsigara n'akangonongono; ahabw'okuba aryaba akukoreire emyaka mukaaga, iwe omwihwire kimwe kya kabiri eky'ebihembo by'omupakasi. Ku oritwaza otyo, MUKAMA aryakuha omugisha omu bi orikukora byona.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Emijigaijo yoona ey'enimi n'empaya erizaarwa omu masyo gaawe g'ente n'ag'entaama, oryaguma ogyereze MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; otarikoresa omujigaijo gw'ente yaawe, kandi otarikyemura ebyoya by'omujigaijo gw'entaama yaawe. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kureka iwe n'ab'omu ka yaawe muryaguriira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe buri mwaka omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Kwonka ku guriba gwine akamogo, oburema nari obuhumi, nari akandi kamogo koona akabi, otarigutambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Oryaguriira omu ka yaawe; abatashemeire n'abashemeire boona nibaikirizibwa kuguryaho, nk'oku barya esirabo n'empara. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10">Lev 17:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka otarirya eshagama yaagwo, kureka oryagyata ahansi nk'amaizi.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Okuhingurwaho n'agandi magyenyi makuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Yoh 18:28</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:28">Heb 11:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryaguma oijukye okwezi kwa Abibu, orinde obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; ahabw'okuba omu kwezi kwa Abibu nibwo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaakwiha omuri Misri nyekiro. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:7">1 Kor 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oryatambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ekitambo ky'Okuhingurwaho, nookiiha omu masyo g'entaama nari ag'ente, okitambire omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Otarikiriisa omugaati gutumbisiibwe; oryamara ebiro mushanju nookiriisa omugaati gutatumbisiibwe, nigwo mugaati gw'okubonabona,–ahabw'okuba okaruga omu nsi ya Misri n'obwira,–obone kwijuka eizooba eri waarugiireho omu nsi ya Misri ebiro byawe byona. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Otarireebwa oine ekitumbisa kyona omu nsi yaawe yoona okumara ebiro mushanju; kandi hatarigira enyama yoona ey'ekitambo, eki oritamba aha izooba ry'okubanza omu mwabazyo, eyaaraaraho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Otaritambira ekitambo ky'Okuhingurwaho omu rurembo rwona aha ndembo ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha; <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:46">Mat 27:46</ref>. </char></note> kureka omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye, nimwo oritambira omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho omu mwabazyo, eizooba nirirengarenga, omu bunaku obu waarugiiremu Misri. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:8">Kur 12:8</ref>. </char></note> Oryagwotsya, oguriire omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aritoorana; kandi omu kasheeshe ohindukye ogarukye omu mahema gaawe. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Oryamara ebiro mukaaga noorya emigaati etatumbisiibwe, kandi aha kiro kya mushanju habeho okuteerana okwereziibwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe; otarikikoreraho omurimo gwona.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:16">Kur 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:1">Byak 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryayebarira saabiiti mushanju; ozibare noihirira aha bunaku obu oritandikiraho kuta omusyo gw'engyesho aha ngano zaawe. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:22">Enf 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Oryarinda obugyenyi bwa saabiiti mushanju ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe nooreeta omutoijo gw'empongano yaawe ogu oritoija n'omutima ogwekundiire, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba akuhaire omugisha; <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />kandi oryayesiimira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye, iwe na mutabani waawe na muhara waawe n'omuhuuku waawe n'omuzaana waawe n'Omuleevi otwire omu marembo gaawe n'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi abatwire naimwe; <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:15">Bir 15:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi oryaijuka ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omuri Misiri; ote omutima aha biragiro ebi ebyatairweho, kandi obyorobere.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi oryarinda obugyenyi bw'Ensiisira, okumara ebiro mushanju, ku oriheza kuhunika eby'aha mbuga yaawe n'eby'omu inyuukiro ryawe; <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:9">Neh 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:1-6">Isa 12:1-6</ref>. </char></note> oryashemererwa aha bugyenyi bwawe, iwe na mutabani waawe na muhara waawe n'omuhuuku waawe n'omuzaana waawe n'Omuleevi n'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi abatwire naiwe. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Oryamara ebiro mushanju noorinda obwo bugyenyi ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ori omu mwanya ogu aritoorana; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryakuha omugisha omu bi oriba oyerize byona, n'omu bi oriba okozire n'emikono yaawe byona; kandi oshemerererwe kimwe.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Buri mwaka abantu baawe boona abeetwa abashaija baryaguma bareebwe kashatu omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe omu mwanya ogu aritoorana-aha bugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe, aha bugyenyi bwa saabiiti mushanju, n'aha bugyenyi bw'Ensiisira; kandi batarireebwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA engaro nsha; <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:12">2 Kor 8:12</ref>. </char></note> buri muntu aryaguma ahe nk'oku arikubaasa, nk'omugisha ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba amuhaire oku guri.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Oryataho abaramuzi n'abategyeki omu ndembo zaawe zoona ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha, nk'enganda zaawe oku ziri, bagume bacwere abantu emanja z'oburyo. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 17:23">Enf 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:23">24:23</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:7">Mub 7:7</ref>. </char></note> Otariita orubanja; otarishoroora omu bantu; kandi otarirya enguzi, ahakuba enguzi eita amaisho g'abanyabwengye, kandi eita emanja z'abahikiriire. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Eby'oburyo, eby'oburyo byonka, obe nibyo waakuratira, obone kugumaho, ohungure ensi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:13">Kur 34:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:33">1 Bag 16:33</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:3">2 Bus 33:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaribyara ekiti kyona eky'omurinzi aha rubaju rw'eitambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, eri orikora. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Kandi otaryebyarira enyomyo y'eibaare, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ayanga.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Otaritambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe enimi nari entaama, eine akamogo nari akacokore koona; ahabw'okuba ekyo n'ekihagaro ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuzibira abantu kuramya ekishushani kyona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Omuriimwe, omuri ibara rurembo aha ndembo zaanyu, ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha, ku harireebekamu omushaija nari omukazi orikukora ekirikwangwa MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ekirikwita endagaano ye, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />akaza kuheereza baaruhanga abandi, akabaramya, nari shi akaramya eizooba nari okwezi nari ekintu kyona eky'omu ihe ry'eby'omu iguru, eki ntarabaragiire; <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />ku baribikugambira, waabihurira, oyezirikye kubibuuririza; ku orishanga biri eby'amazima, bitarikubanganisibwa, ku ekyo kihagaro kikoreirwe omuri Israeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />muryashohoza ogwo mushaija nari ogwo mukazi okozire ekyo kihagaro, mumutware omu irembo ry'orurembo rwanyu, yaaba mushaija nari omukazi, mumuteere amabaare, afe. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Kor 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Heb 10:28</ref>. </char></note> Ow'okufa aryaitwa ahabwa baamushinja babiri nari bashatu; atariitwa ahabwa mushinja omwe. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Emikono ya baamushinja ebe niyo yaamubanza, bwanyima hateho ey'abandi boona. Ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekibi omuriimwe.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuramura emanja kw'abanyamurwa n'abaramuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 19:10">2 Bus 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:17">Bir 19:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haribaho orubanja rwakurema, yaaba rw'obwitani bw'emiringo etari emwe, nari orw'entongane, nari orw'endwano, ebi barikufa omu marembo gaanyu, bwanyima oryaimuka, oze omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ariba atooraine, <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />ohikye aha Baleevi abanyamurwa, n'aha muramuzi oriba ariho omu biro ebyo, obeebuuzeho, babone kukumanyisa oku orubanja rushemereire kucuubwa; <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />bwanyima oryatwaza nk'okucwa kwabo oku kuri, oku barikuhaburira omuri ogwo mwanya gu MUKAMA ariba atooraine, oteho omutima kukora byona ebi barikwegyesa. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Oryakora nk'ebi bariba bakuhabwire oku biri, kandi nk'okucwa oku bariba bakugambiire oku kuri; otariza aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, okateishuka aha rubanja nk'oku bariba bakuhabwire. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:8">Ezr 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:4">Hos 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu origira amaryo, akanga kuhurira omunyamurwa, oriba naayemerera okwo omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nari omuramuzi, ogwo muntu aryaitwa, obone kwiha ekibi omuri Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />N'abantu boona baryahurira, batiine, barekye kugaruka kugira amaryo.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okutaho omugabe n'oku ashemereire kutwaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:19">1 Sam 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:9">Hos 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muriba mwahikire omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha, mwagikubuura, mwagituuramu, mwagira muti, Ka tweteereho omugabe atutegyekye, nk'amahanga goona agatwehinguririize oku gari, <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />buzimazima mutaribura kweteeraho omugabe ou MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aritoorana. Ou muritaho aryaba ow'omuri beene waanyu; mutaritaho omunyaihanga otari w'omuri beene waanyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:28">1 Bag 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Isa 31:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ataritunga embaraasi nyingi, n'obu kwakuba okugarura abantu omuri Misri, ngu abone kwetungirayo embaraasi nyingi; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akabagira ati: Mutarigaruka kutoora ogwo muhanda. <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:3">1 Bag 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:21">10:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi arekye kushwera abakazi baingi, omutima gwe gukahinduka gukaruga ahari MUKAMA; kandi ataryekanyisiza efeeza n'ezaabu nyingi. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:8">2 Bag 22:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku ariheza kuza aha ngoma, aryayehandiikira ebiragiro ebi omu kitabo, naabiiha omu kitabo ky'Abaleevi abanyamurwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:8">Yos 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kitabo agume nakyo, agume akishomemu ebiro byona ebi arimara akiriho, abone kwega kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga we, n'okukwata ebigambo byona eby'ebiragiro n'ebyatairweho, n'okubyorobera, <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Bir 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:5">1 Bag 15:5</ref>. </char></note> omutima gwe gurekye kwehimbisiza ahari beene waabo, akateishuka aha biragiro, akatoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, haza obwo abone kuhangaarira omu bugabe bwe omuri Israeli, we n'oruzaaro rwe.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okutunga Abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:9">Kub 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:13">1 Kor 9:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaleevi abanyamurwa nirwo ruganda rwona orwa Leevi, batarigira omugabo nari obuhunguzi omu Baisraeli, kureka baryaguma nibarya aha mpongano z'okwokibwa omu muriro, ezihongyeirwe MUKAMA, n'ebindi ebi bashemereire kuheebwa. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Batarigira obuhunguzi omuri beene waabo. MUKAMA niwe buhunguzi bwabo, nk'oku yaabagambiire. <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Kandi ogwo nigwo mugabo gw'abanyamurwa ogushemereire kwihwa omu bantu; abarikutamba ebitambo, yaaba nte nari entaama, baryaguma nibaihiraho omunyamurwa ekivune ky'omukono, n'emishaya yombi, n'ekishansha. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:12">Kub 18:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omunyamurwa muryamuha aha miganuro y'ebi mwerize, engano zaanyu, na viinyo yaanyu, n'amajuta gaanyu ag'emizeituuni, kandi n'ebyoya by'okubanza eby'entaama zaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Ahakuba niwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaatooraine omu nganda zaanyu zoona, ngu ayemerere kuheereza omu iziina rya MUKAMA, we n'abatabani ebiro byona.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Kandi Omuleevi ku arifuruka omuri ibara rurembo aha ndembo zaanyu, ahu ariba atwire hoona omuri Israeli, yaaza omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA aritoorana akyekundiire, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />nawe aryaikirizibwa kuheereza omu iziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga we, nka bagyenzi be boona Abaleevi, abeemerera okwo omu maisho ga MUKAMA, oku baheereza. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:4">2 Bus 31:4</ref>. </char></note> Aryatunga omugabo gw'eby'okurya ogurikwingana n'ey'abandi, otabariireho ebyarugire omu kutunda ebi ishe yaamuragire.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:27">Lev 18:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku murihika omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha, mutaritooreza emicwe y'amahanga ago erikwangwa. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Hatarigira omuntu weena omuriimwe owaarabya mutabani we nari muhara we omu muriro, nari owaaba omufumu, nari orikuragura ebiribaho, nari omuteezi w'ebyatsi, nari omucecezi, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />nari omuhi w'engisha, nari orikubandwa emizimu, nari omurogi, nari orikubuuza abafu. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:24">Lev 18:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba orikukora ebyo weena n'ekirikunugwa ahari MUKAMA, kandi ahabw'ebirikunugwa ebyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu nikyo arikubingira amahanga ago omu maisho gaanyu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:32">Zab 18:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat 5:48</ref>. </char></note> Mube abahikire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; <verse eid="DEU 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:6">2 Bag 21:6</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba amahanga ago, agu murikubuura, gata omutima aha barikuragura ebiribaho n'aha bafumu; kwonka imwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu takabaikirizaga kukora mutyo.<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuragura kw'okwija kwa nabi omukuru Masiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:3">Mat 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:19-26">Yoh 4:19-26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:22">Byak 3:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryabaimukiza nabi nkaanye, arugye omuriimwe omuri beene waanyu; ogwo niwe murihurira; <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />buzima kiryaba nk'ebi mwashabire MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu byona, muri ahari Horebu aha izooba riri eri mwabaire muteeraine, nimugira muti: Nitukweshengyereza tutagaruka kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, n'obu kwakuba okureeba ogu muriro mwingi obundi, tutakaafa. <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />MUKAMA yangira ati: Ebi bagambire byona, bihikire. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:45">Yoh 1:45</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:8">Yoh 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:49">12:49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:50">50</ref>. </char></note> Ndyabaimukiza nabi nkaiwe omuribo omuri beene waabo, nte ebigambo byangye omu kanwa ke, abagambire ebi ndimuragiira byona. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Byak 3:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi weena oryanga kuhurira ebigambo byangye ebi arigamba omu iziina ryangye, ndyakimutura. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Bir 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:14">Yer 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nabi oryetuma kugamba ekigambo omu iziina ryangye eki ntamuragiire kugamba, nari shi origamba omu iziina rya baaruhanga abandi, nabi ogwo aryafa. <verse eid="DEU 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Kandi ku muryebuuza omu mitima yaanyu muti: Nitubaasa tuta kumanya ekigambo eki MUKAMA atagambire? <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 28:9">Yer 28:9</ref>. </char></note> Nabi ku arigamba omu iziina rya MUKAMA, eki yaagamba kitaabaho, nari kitaabakwo, biri ekigambo ekyo MUKAMA tiwe akigambire; kureka nabi ogwo niwe akyetumire; mutarimutiina.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Endembo z'okuhungiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ku ariheza kucwekyereza amahanga agu arikubaha ensi yaago, mwagakubuura, mwatuura omu ndembo zaabo n'omu maka gaabo, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:2">Yos 20:2</ref>. </char></note> muryayetooranira endembo ishatu omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kukubuura; <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />mweteereho emihanda, mubaganise ensi yaanyu ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha omu bicweka bishatu, oriita omuntu weena ahungireyo.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Ebi nibyo byatairweho ahabw'oriita omuntu, ngu ahungireyo, akire. Omuntu weena oriita omuntu, atamwitsire nkana, kandi ashangirwe atarikumwanga, <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />(nk'oku omuntu agyenda na mugyenzi we omu kibira kutiganda, akeereeza empango kutema ekiti, ekasyoka omu muhini, ekateera mugyenzi we ogwo, ekamwita), ahungire omuri rumwe ahari ezo ndembo, akire, <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />orikuhoorera kiitwa atarikurata kiita akiine ekiniga, akamukwatira omu muhanda ahabw'okuba hare, akamuteera, akamugwisaho; haza kunu yaaba atashemereire kwitwa, ahabw'okuba abaire atarikumwanga. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Nikyo ndikubaragiirira nti: Muryayetooranira endembo ishatu. <verse eid="DEU 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Kut 15:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ku arihangusya ensi yaanyu, nk'oku yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, yaabaha ensi yoona ebi yaaraganiise baashwenkuriimwe kubaha, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />kandi ku murigumizamu kukwata ebiragiro ebi byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'okugyendera omu mihanda ye ebiro byona, ahari ezo ndembo ishatu muryayongyeraho ezindi ishatu, <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />eshagama y'abataine rubanja erekye kusheesherwa omu nsi yaanyu, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuba obuhunguzi, mukagiibwaho orubanja rwayo.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:12">Kur 21:12</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:15">1 Yoh 3:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuntu ku ariba naayanga mugyenzi we, yaamugwera, yaamugurukira, yaamuteera munonga, yaafa; bwanyima yaahungira omuri rumwe ahari ezo ndembo, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />abakuru b'orurembo rwe baryatuma, bamwiheyo, bamuheyo aha muhoozi w'enzigu, aitwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:31">1 Bag 2:31</ref>. </char></note> Amaisho gaanyu gatarimusaasira, kureka muryaiha omuri Israeli eshagama y'otaine rubanja, mubone kuba gye.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro ky'abajurizi abarikujurira ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:17">Bir 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 24:2">Yob 24:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarikuura ekiti ky'omwatano gwa mutaahi waawe, ekyabyairwe aba ira omu buhunguzi obu oriheebwa omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha kukubuura.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:17">Yoh 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Kor 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:28">Heb 10:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mushinja omwe atariikirizibwa kushinja omuntu eki ashobize nari ekibi kyona eki akozire; kureka okushinja kwa baamushinja babiri nari bashatu nikwo kurihamya ekigambo kyona. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:12">Zab 27:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:13">1 Bag 21:13</ref>. </char></note> Mushinja w'ebishuba ku ariimuka kushinja omuntu ekibi, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />abarikutongana bombi baryayemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA, omu maisho g'abanyamurwa n'abaramuzi abariba bariho omu biro ebyo; <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />abaramuzi babuuririze munonga; mushinja ku ariba ari ow'ebishuba, abeihereire mugyenzi we, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:5">Enf 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:24">Dan 6:24</ref>. </char></note> mumugire nk'oku abaire naayenda kugira mugyenzi we; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekibi omuriimwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:13">Bir 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:21">21:21</ref>. </char></note> Abaritsigaraho baryabihurira, batiine; okuruga aho tibarigaruka kukorera omuriimwe ekibi nk'ekyo. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23">Kur 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5:38</ref>. </char></note> Amaisho gaanyu gatarigira esaasi; amagara garyaguma garihwe agandi, eriisho ririhwe erindi, eriino ririhwe erindi, engaro erihwe endiijo, n'ekigyere kirihwe ekindi.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'engamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:21">Kub 23:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:7">2 Bus 32:7</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 32:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Zab 23:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku murihurura kurwanisa abazigu baanyu, mwareeba embaraasi n'ebigaari, n'engabo ezirikukira ezaanyu, mutaribatiina; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri aryaba ari hamwe naimwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Kandi ku muriba muri haihi kurwana, omunyamurwa airire haihi abantu, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />abagire ati: Muhurire, imwe Abaisraeli; eri izooba mwairira haihi abazigu baanyu kubarwanisa; emitima yaanyu etafoobeera; mutatiina, mutatetema, mutahahaaza emitima ahabwabo; <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:30">Bir 1:30</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:10">Yos 23:10</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe arikugyenda naimwe kubarwanira n'abazigu baanyu n'okubajuna. <verse eid="DEU 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:27">Neh 12:27</ref>. </char></note> N'abakuru b'engabo baryabuuza abantu bati: Omuriimwe harimu obaire ayombekire enju nsya, otakagyerize; ku araabe ariho, agarukyeyo, ataahe omuri egyo nju, atakaafeera omu rugamba, ekeezibwa ondiijo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Hariho owaabyaire omusiri gw'emizaabibu, otakariire ha bijuma byagwo? Nawe agarukyeyo, ataahe omu ka ye, atakaafeera omu rugamba, ondiijo akabirya. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:5">Bir 24:5</ref>. </char></note> Hariho ogambire omukazi obugyenyi, otakamushweire? Nawe agarukyeyo, ataahe omu ka ye, atakaafeera omu rugamba, ondiijo akamushwera. <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:3">Bar 7:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abakuru b'engabo baryagaruka babuuze abantu bati: Omuriimwe harimu omuntu ekinyabwoba, ow'omutima gufoobeire? Ogwo nawe agarukyeyo, ataahe omu ka ye, emitima ya beene waabo etakaahaha nk'ogwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Abo bakuru b'engabo ku bariheza kugambira abantu ebigambo ebyo, bateho abakuru b'amahe kwebembera abantu.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Ku murihika haihi n'orurembo kururwanisa, mubanze murugambire eby'obusingye. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:21">1 Bag 9:21</ref>. </char></note> Ku ruribagarukamu eby'obusingye, rwabaigurira, boona abu murishangamu baryabakorera emirimo y'obuhuuku, kandi babaheereze. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Kwonka ku ruryanga kuragaana naimwe eby'obusingye, kureka rwayenda kubarwanisa, muryarugota; <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />MUKAMA ku ariruhayo omu mikono yaanyu, muryaita oyetwa omushaija weena na rurara; <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:2">Yos 8:2</ref>. </char></note> kwonka abakazi n'abaana bato, n'ebirurimu byona, n'amatungo, niyo minyago yaamwo yoona mubyetwarire; kandi muryarya ebi murinyaga aha bazigu baanyu, ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahaire. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Okwo nikwo muritwaza endembo zoona ezibari hare munonga, ezitari z'aga mahanga. <verse eid="DEU 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:2">Kub 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:14">Yos 11:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu ndembo ez'aga mahanga, ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuba obuhunguzi, mutarigira ekintu kyona ekirikwitsya eki mwarokora; <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />kureka muryabahwerekyerereza kimwe, Abahiiti, n'Abaamori, n'Abanyakanaani, n'Abaperizi, n'Abahiivi, n'Abayebusi, nk'oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabaragiire, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-17">Kur 34:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:12">Yos 23:12</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 23:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:33">1 Kor 15:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:34-41">Zab 106:34-41</ref>. </char></note> nyentsya bataribeegyesa kutooreza ebihagaro byabo byona ebi baabaire nibakorera baaruhanga baabo, mukacumura ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Ku murimara omwanya muraingwa mugotsire orurembo nimururwanisa kurukwata, mutaritema emiti yaarwo n'empango, mukagiraza; ahabw'okuba obundi mukaabaasa kurya aha bijuma byayo; n'ahabw'ekyo mutarigitema. Nimugira ngu emiti y'omu ishwa nayo n'abantu, imwe okugigota? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Emiti ei murikumanya ngu teeyera bijuma ebirikuriibwa, egyo yonka niyo muritema, mukaraza, mukombekyesa eby'okwemereraho ahari orwo rurembo orurikubarwanisa, okuhitsya obu rurisingurwa.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ekarabo y'obwitsi obutamanyirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:12">Zab 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kukubuura, omutumbi gw'omuntu oitsirwe ku gurishangwa omu ishwa, omwitsire atarikumanywa, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />abakuru baanyu n'abaramuzi baryaija, bateere entambwe okuruga aha mutumbi gw'oitsirwe okuhika aha ndembo ezeehinguririizeho; <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />abakuru b'orurembo oruri haihi n'ogwo mutumbi baryatwara enyana y'eruutsi etakakoresiibweho n'obu kwakuba okukurura ekintu kyona n'endiijo, <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />bagishuumye omu ruhanga orurimu akagyera k'amaizi agarikugyenda, oruhanga orutahingirwe, kandi orutabibirwemu, bagihendere ebitsya omuri orwo ruhanga. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:8">Bir 17:8</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 17:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamurwa beene Leevi bairire haihi; ahakuba nibo MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaatooraine kumuheereza n'okushabira abantu omugisha omu iziina rya MUKAMA, kandi nibo bashemereire kucwa orubanja rw'empaka zoona n'orw'obuhuta bwona. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 73:13">Zab 73:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:24">Mat 27:24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abakuru boona ab'orwo rurembo oruri haihi n'omutumbi gw'oitsirwe banaabire engaro zaabo ahari egyo nyana y'eruutsi, ei ebitsya byayo byahenderwa omuri orwo ruhanga; <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:28">2 Sam 3:28</ref>. </char></note> beehakane nibagira bati: Emikono yaitu tiyo eseesire egi shagama, kandi n'amaisho gaitu tigagireebire neesheesheka. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:15">Yer 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="JON 1:14">Yon 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, saasira abantu baawe Israeli, abu waacungwire, otata orubanja rw'eshagama y'otaine rubanja aha bantu baawe Israeli; kureka basaasirwe orubanja rw'egyo shagama. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ku muritwaza mutyo, mwakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, muryaiha omuriimwe orubanja rw'eshagama y'otaine rubanja.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekiragiro ky'okushwerwa kw'omukazi onyagirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Ku orihurura kurwanisa abazigu baawe, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yaabahayo omu mikono yaawe, waabatwara bari enkwatwa, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />waabareebamu omukazi murungi, waamurigira, waayenda kumushwera, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />oryamutwara owaawe, amweise eishokye rye, acwe ebyara, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:10">Zab 45:10</ref>. </char></note> ajuure ebijwaro ebi akwatiirwemu, agume omu ka yaawe, amare okwezi kwona naaririra ishe na nyina; bwanyima obone kumushwera, obe iba, nawe abe omukazi waawe. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Bwanyima ku otarimusiima, omurekye agyende, aze ahi arikwenda; kwonka otarimutunda empiiha, kandi otarimutwaza nk'omuzaana, ahabw'okuba oryaba omusiisire.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 29:33">Kut 29:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija, ku ariba aine abakazi babiri, omwe ari enkundwakazi, n'ondi ari enyangwakazi, kandi bombi bamuzaariire abaana, enkundwakazi n'enyangwakazi; kandi omwana w'omwojo ow'okubanza ku ariba ari ow'enyangwakazi, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:3">2 Bus 21:3</ref>. </char></note> aha izooba eri ariragiraho abaana be ebi atungire, tariikirizibwa kuhindura omwana w'enkundwakazi kuba omwana we mukuru okukira ogwo ow'enyangwakazi owaabandize kuzaarwa; <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:5">Kut 25:5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 25:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 25:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 5:1">1 Bus 5:1</ref>. </char></note> kureka aryaikiriza omwana w'enyangwakazi owaabandize kuzaarwa, ahabw'okumuraga emigabo ebiri y'ebi atungire; ahabw'okuba niwe maani ge ag'okuzaara gaatandikiireho; n'ebishemereire omwana w'okubanza n'ebye.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekifubiro ky'omwana empiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:15">Kur 21:15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 21:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:8">Enf 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:5">15:5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku ariba aine omwana w'omwojo empiga kandi omugomi, otarikuhurira ishe nari nyina, n'obu baakumuhana bata, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ishe na nyina baryamukwata, bamutwarire abakuru b'orurembo rwabo aha irembo ryarwo, <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />bagambire abakuru b'orwo rurembo bati: Ogu mwana waitu aba empiga kandi omugomi, tatuhurira; n'omunyamururu kandi omusinzi. <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Abashaija boona ab'omu rurembo rwabo baryamuteera amabaare, afe. Ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuriimwe; Abaisraeli boona baryakihurira, batiine.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 22:26">Bir 22:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuntu ku arikora ekibi ekishemereire kumwitsa, bwanyima yaitwa, waamuhanika aha muti, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:29">Yos 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:31">Yoh 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:25">Lev 18:25</ref>. </char></note> omutumbi gwe gutariguraaraho, kureka omuziikye eryo izooba; ahabw'okuba ohanikwa aha muti, aba akyeenirwe Ruhanga-orekye kushiisha ensi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha kuba obuhunguzi.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:4">Kur 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:7">2 Pet 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:9">Zek 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarireeba ente nari entaama ya mwene waanyu neebura, okagyehuzya; buzimazima oryagigarurayo owa mwene waanyu. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Kandi mwene waanyu ku ariba akuri hare, nari ku oriba otarikumumanya, oryagitaasya omuka, ogume nayo, okuhitsya obu mwene waanyu arigisherura; bwanyima okagimugarurira. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Kandi n'endogoya ye oryagitwaza otyo, n'ekijwaro kye okitwaze otyo, kandi otwaze otyo n'ekindi kintu kyona ekya mwene waanyu, ekiriba kibuzire okakibona; otaribyehuzya. <verse eid="DEU 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Otarireeba endogoya ya mwene waanyu nari ente ye egwire aha muhanda, okagyehuzya; otaribura kumuhwera kugiimutsya.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Omukazi atarijwara kishaija; kandi n'omushaija atarijwara kikazi; ahakuba weena orikukora ebyo, n'ekihagaro ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 22:28">Lev 22:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:9">Zab 145:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 12:10">Enf 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:6">Luk 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku origwa aha kyashuri ky'enyonyi omu muti nari ahansi, kirimu ebyana nari amahuri, nyinabyo ebibumbatiire, otarigitwara nabyo; <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />oryareka nyinabyo egyende, reero ebyana obitware, obone kuba gye, ohangaare.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Ku oryombeka enju nsya, ote aha mutwe gwayo eky'okuzibira abantu kugwa, kigyehinguririze, orekye kureetera enju yaawe orubanja rw'eshagama ahabw'omuntu kugihanukaho, akagwa ahansi.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:19">Lev 19:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaribiba omu musiri gwawe gw'emizaabibu embibo z'emiringo ebiri, okaakwa ebyeziremu byona, eby'ezo mbibo n'eby'emizaabiru. <verse eid="DEU 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:14-16">2 Kor 6:14-16</ref>. </char></note> Otarikomerana ente n'endogoya kukurura ekyoma ky'okuhingisa. <verse eid="DEU 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Otarijwara ekijwaro ekikozirwe omu byoya by'entaama n'ehuuzi za kitaani.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Kub 15:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat 23:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryaguma ote ebijwengye aha nshonda ina z'omukugiro gw'omunagiro, ogu orikujwara.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 29:21">Kut 29:21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:28">Efe 5:28</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 5:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku arishwera omwishiki, yaabyama nawe, bwanyima yaamwanga, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />yaamugambaho ebigambo ebirikumuhemura, yaashiisha eiziina rye naagira ati: Nshweire ogu mwishiki; ku mbyamire nawe, naashanga ataine bumanyiso bw'okutamanya mushaija; <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />bwanyima ishe w'omwishiki na nyina baryatwara obumanyiso bwe bw'okutamanya mushaija, babuhitsye aha bakuru b'orurembo rwabo aha irembo ryarwo; <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />ishe w'ogwo mwishiki agambire abakuru ati: Nkahingira ogu mushaija muhara wangye; mbwenu amwangire, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />kandi yaamugambaho ebirikumuhemura, naagira ati: Nshangire muhara waawe ataine bumanyiso bw'okutamanya mushaija. Mbwenu obu nibwo bumanyiso bwa muhara wangye bw'okutamanya mushaija. Baryayara omwenda omu maisho g'abakuru b'orurembo. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:4">Rom 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru b'orwo rurembo bakwate ogwo mushaija, bamuteere; <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />bamuhongyese shekeli z'efeeza igana, bazihe ishe w'omwishiki, nibamutura okushiisha eiziina ry'omwishiki Omwisraeli, agarukye abe omukazi we; atarimushenda ebiro byona ebi arimara omu nsi. <verse eid="DEU 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Kwonka ku kirishangwa kiri eky'amazima ngu ogwo mwishiki tarashangirwe na bumanyiso bw'okutamanya mushaija, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:9">Lev 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 20:6">Bar 20:6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13:12">2 Sam 13:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 13:13">13</ref>. </char></note> baryashohoza omwishiki aha muryango gw'enju ya ishe, abashaija b'omu rurembo rw'owaabo bamwitse amabaare, ahabw'okukora ekibi ky'obufamutima omuri Israeli, kuraayira omu ka ya ishe; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuri Israeli.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:27">Mat 5:27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:9">1 Kor 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku arishangwa naashambana na muka omushaija, bombi baryaitwa, omushaija owaaba abyami n'omukazi, kandi n'ogwo mukazi; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuri Israeli.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Ku hariba hariho omwishiki, orikugambwa obugyenyi, omushaija yaamushanga omu rurembo, yaabyama nawe, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />bombi muryabashohoza aha irembo ry'orwo rurembo, mubaitse amabaare; omwishiki mumwite ahabw'okutateera nduuru, haza ari omu rurembo; n'omushaija mumwite ahabw'okushiisha omukazi wa mutaahi we; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuri Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Kwonka omushaija ku arishanga omwishiki orikugambwa obugyenyi omu ishwa, yaamuhamba, yaabyama nawe, obwo ogwo mushaija obyamire nawe niwe ariitwa wenka; <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />kwonka omwishiki mutarigira eki mwamukora; aryaba ataine rubanja orushemereire kumwitsa; nimumanya ngu orubanja orwo ni nk'orw'omuntu ogurukaine mutaahi we, akamwita; <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />ahakuba omushaija aryaba amushangire omu ishwa; ogwo mwishiki orikugambwa obugyenyi, n'obu yaakuteire enduuru, tihaine waakumujunire. <verse eid="DEU 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:16">Kur 22:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ku arishanga omwishiki otakagambirwe bugyenyi, yaamuhamba, yaabyama nawe, kandi baakwatwa; <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />ogwo mushaija obyamire nawe aryariha ishe w'omwishiki shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano, bwanyima abe omukazi we, ahabw'okuba amusiisire; kandi atarimushenda ebiro byona ebi ariba akiriho.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:11">Lev 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 5:1">1 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija atarishwera muka ishe, akajweka ishe busha.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Oyatikire amagosi, nari oshazirweho obushaija atariza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA. <verse eid="DEU 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Ekinyandaaro kitariza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA; hatarigira ow'omu ruzaaro rwakyo owaaza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA okuhitsya aha ruzaaro rwakyo rw'omwijukuru wa ikumi. <verse eid="DEU 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:5">Rus 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:1">Neh 13:1</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Omuamoni nari Omumoabu atariza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA; hatarigira ow'omu ruzaaro rwabo owaaza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA ebiro byona okuhitsya aha ruzaaro rwabo rw'omwijukuru wa ikumi; <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:29">Bir 2:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:41-46">Mat 25:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:5">Kub 22:5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 22:6">6</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba tibarababuganiise by'okurya n'amaizi omu muhanda nimuruga Misri, n'ahabw'okugurira Balamu mwene Beori owa Pesori wa Mesopotamia, ngu abakyeene. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:2">Enf 26:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaayanga kuhurira Balamu, kureka MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omukyeeno yaaguhindura omugisha ahariimwe, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu akabakunda. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:12">Ezr 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Mutaribatengyera obusingye n'obu kwakuba okuba gye ebiro byanyu byona.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:24">Kut 25:24</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:12">Oba 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:19">Bir 10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutaryangira kimwe Abanyaedomu, ahabw'okuba ni beene waanyu; mutaryangira kimwe Abanyamisri, ahabw'okuba mukaba muri abanyaihanga omu nsi yaabo. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Oruzaaro rwabo orw'abaana ba baijukuru baabo baryaikirizibwa kuza omu kuteerana kw'abantu ba MUKAMA.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Ku murihurura kurwanisa abazigu baanyu, mwateera orusiisira, muryaguma mwerinde ekintu kyona ekibi. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:16">Lev 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Omuriimwe ku harireebekamu omuntu otashemeire ahabw'ekiriba kimubaireho nyekiro, ashohore arugye omu rusiisira, arekye kurugarukamu; <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />kwonka ku burihika omu mwabazyo, ayogye omu maizi; kandi eizooba ku ririheza kurenga, agarukye omu rusiisira.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Kandi muryagira omwanya aheeru y'orusiisira ahu muriguma nimushohorera; <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />omu by'okurwanisa byanyu muryagiramu ekihosho; omuntu ku arishohora kuza aha ishaazi, akitimbise ekiina; yaaza kurugaho, ashwekye ahi yaaruga; <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe agyendagyenda omu rusiisira rwanyu, okubajuna n'okuhayo abazigu baanyu omu maisho gaanyu; n'ahabw'ekyo orusiisira rwanyu rushemereire kuba orurikwera; MUKAMA arekye kureeba omuriimwe ekintu kyona ekitashemeire, akahinduka akabarugaho.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 30:15">1 Sam 30:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuhuuku owaacwire kuruga ahari mukama we, akakwehongyera, otarimumugarurira; <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 7:10">Zek 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:6">Yak 2:6</ref>. </char></note> aryaguma naiwe, atuure omuriimwe omu mwanya ogu aritoorana omuri rumwe aha ndembo zaanyu, ahu arisiima hoona; otarimwita kubi.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 2:16">Enf 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:7">2 Bag 23:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hatarigira owaaba maraaya omuri bahara b'Abaisraeli, kandi hatarigira owaaba ekitingwa omuri batabani baabo. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Otarireeta omu nju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ekiconco kya maraaya nari eky'ekitingwa, kuhikiiriza eki waaraganiise noorahira kuha MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba ebyo n'ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ayangira kimwe.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 5:7">Neh 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 15:5">Zab 15:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariguza mwene waanyu, ngu akutemu ekiteebwamu, ekiteebwamu aha mpiiha, aha by'okurya, nari aha kindi kintu kyona ekiguzibwa kwihamu ekiteebwamu. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:34">Lev 19:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:10">Bir 15:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omunyaihanga noikirizibwa kumuguza ahabw'ekiteebwamu; beitu mwene waanyu otarimuguza ahabw'enshaagi, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe abone kukuha omugisha omuri byona ebi orikora n'emikono yaawe omu nsi ei orikuza kuhungura.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 5:4">Mub 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 5:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku origira eki waaraganisa MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe noorahira, otaryeganda kukihikiiriza; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe taribura kukikubuuza, kikakurugiramu ekibi. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Kwonka ku oriba otakiraganiise, tikirikurugiramu kibi. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 66:13">Zab 66:13</ref>. </char></note> Oryataho omutima kuhikiiriza ekirugire omu kanwa kaawe, ahakuba eki waaraganiise MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe n'akanwa kaawe, okakiraganisa oyekundiire.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:1">Mat 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oriza omu musiri gwa mutaahi waawe gw'emizaabibu, noikirizibwa kurya ebijuma by'emizaabibu nk'oku orikwenda, okahaaga; kwonka otarigira ebi waashoromera omu kintu eki oine. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Kandi ku oriza omu ngano za mutaahi waawe, noikirizibwa kucwa obushiisha n'engaro, kwonka otarigyeshesa omusyo engano ze.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mak 10:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku aritwara omukazi, yaamushwera, bwanyima ataamusiima ahabw'okureeba aine emicwe mibi, naikirizibwa kuhandiika ebaruha y'okumushenda, agimukwatse, amubingye omu nju ye. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Ogwo mukazi ku araarugye omuri egyo nju, naikirizibwa kushwerwa ondiijo mushaija. <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />Kwonka ogwo mushaija owaaba amushweire bushumbakazi nawe ku araamwangye, yaahandiika ebaruha y'okumushenda, yaagimukwatsa, yaamubinga omu nju ye, nari shi yaafa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:1">Yer 3:1</ref>. </char></note> omushaija we ow'okubanza owaamubingire tariikirizibwa kumugarura akaba omukazi we, yaaherize kusiisikara atyo; ahabw'okuba ekyo n'ekihagaro omu maisho ga MUKAMA, kandi mutarireeta orubanja aha nsi, ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kuba obuhunguzi.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 5:18">Enf 5:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija ku arishwera omukazi, atarihurura n'abandi aha rugamba, n'obu kwakuba okukoresibwa omurimo gwona; kureka aryamara omwaka gwona ari omuka, naashemererwa n'omukazi we, ou ashweire.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Hatarigira owaakwatirizibwa orubengo nari eseiso, ahakuba naaba akwatiriziibwe amagara ga mukama waabyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:16">Kur 21:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku arishangwa aine ou yaibire weena omuri beene waabo Abaisraeli, naamutwaza nk'omuhuuku, nari yaamutunda, ogwo mushuma aryaitwa; ku muritwaza mutyo, muryaiha ekyo kibi omuriimwe.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 13:2">Lev 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oriba waakwatsirwe ebibembe, oyerinde, oteho omutima okore ebi abanyamurwa Abaleevi barikuhabura byona; nk'oku naabaragiire, naimwe mube nikwo mwakora. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Kub 12:10</ref>. </char></note> Mwijukye oku MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaagizire Miriamu, muri omu rugyendo nimuruga Misri.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Ku origuza mutaahi waawe, nari waamutiiza ekintu kyona, otariza omu nju ye kwihamu eky'okukukwatiriza; <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />kureka oryayemerera aheeru; ou ogurize abe niwe yaakureetera eky'okukukwatiriza. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Kandi ku ariba ari omworo, otariraazayo eki akukwatiriize; <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 24:7">Yob 24:7</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 24:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:16-20">31:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:7">Ezk 18:7</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:25">Bir 6:25</ref>. </char></note> otaribura kukimugarurira, eizooba nirirengarenga, abone kuraara omu kijwaro kye, akushabire omugisha; ekyo kiryakurugiramu okuhikiirira omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 14:31">Enf 14:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:5">Mal 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita kubi omupakasi, oriba ari omworo nari omukyene, yaaba w'omuri beene waanyu, nari ow'omu banyamahanga oriba atwire omu rurembo rwona aha ndembo z'omu nsi yaanyu; <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:13">Yer 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char></note> oryaguma omuhe ebihembo bye ebi yaakorera, eizooba ritarirenga otakabimuhaire, nyentsya atakaatakira MUKAMA naakutabaariza, haza kikakurugiramu ekibi; ahabw'okuba n'omworo, kandi ebihembo bye nibyo ataireho omutima. <verse eid="DEU 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:6">2 Bag 14:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 14:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:20">Ezk 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Baishe b'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa abaana baabo; kandi n'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa baishebo; kureka omuntu weena aryaitwa ahabw'ekibi kye.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:21">Kur 22:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:23">Isa 1:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariita orubanja rw'omunyaihanga, nari orw'efuuzi; kandi otarikwatirizibwa ekijwaro ky'omufaakazi; <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />kureka oryaguma oijukye ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omuri Misri, kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku yaakucungwire, akakwihayo; nikyo ndikukuzibirira kutwaza otyo. <verse eid="DEU 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:22">Lev 23:22</ref>. </char></note> Ku orishaaruura omusiri gwawe, waayebwayo ekiba, otarigarukayo kukiihayo; kiryaba eky'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe abone kukuha omugisha omu bi orikukora n'emikono yaawe byona. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Ku oriteera omuti gwawe gw'omuzeituuni kwihamu ebijuma, otarigaruka omu mataagi gaagwo; ebiritsigaramu biryaba eby'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Kandi ku orishoroma ebijuma by'emizaabibu yaawe, otarigarukamu kuhumba; ebiritsigaramu bibe eby'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Oryaguma oijukye ku waabaire ori omuhuuku omu nsi Misri; nikyo ndikukuragiirira kutwaza otyo.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ebindi biragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Abantu ku bariba baine eki barikutongana, baija kucwerwa orubanja, abaramuzi baarubacwera, baryaiha orubanja aha muntu otarwine, barusingise okozire kubi; <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />kandi ogwo muntu okozire kubi ku ariba ashemereire kuteerwa, omuramuzi aryaragiira bamurambikye omu maisho ge, bamuteere kiboko ezishemereire ekibi kye. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:24">2 Kor 11:24</ref>. </char></note> Naikirizibwa kumuteera kiboko makumi ana, kwonka atarizirenzya; ahakuba ku arigumizamu kumuteera, yaayeshumbya ahari ezo, aryaba amumaziremu ak'obuntu, haza ari mwene waanyu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 12:10">Enf 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariboha akanwa k'ente neejunga oburo.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:28">Luk 20:28</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 1:12">Rus 1:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abashaija enyine-emwe ku bariba batwire hamwe, omwe yaafa atazaire mwana w'omwojo, omukazi wa nyakufa atarishwerwa otari w'omu ruganda rwa iba; murumuna wa iba niwe arimuhungura, akamushwera, akamukorera ebi muramu w'omuntu akorera muka mukuru we. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:9">Kut 38:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omwojo ou aribanza kuzaara aryahungurira nyakufa, ayetwe eiziina rye, rirekye kweba omuri Israeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Kwonka ogwo mushaija ku ariba atarikwenda kuhungura muka mukuru we, ogwo mukazi aryaza aha bakuru omu irembo ry'orurembo, abagire ati: Muramu wangye ayangire kugaruraho eiziina rya mukuru we omuri Israeli; tarikwenda kunkorera ebi muramu w'omuntu akorera muka mukuru we. <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Abakuru b'orurembo rwabo bamwete, bagambe nawe; ku ariguma ayangire, yaagira ati: Tindikwenda kumuhungura, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:7">Rus 4:7</ref>. </char></note> ogwo mukazi muramu we amuhikye haihi omu maisho g'abakuru, amujuure enkaito, amucwere amacwante omu maisho, amugire ati: Omuntu weena oryanga kwombeka eka ya mukuru we, akorwe atyo. <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Eiziina ry'eka ye omuri Israeli riryayetwa, Eka y'owaajwirwe enkaito. <verse eid="DEU 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Abashaija ku barirwana, omukazi w'omwe aharibo yaaza kujuna iba orikumuteera, yaatayo omukono, yaakwata kiteera iba eifo, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />ogwo mukazi oryamucwaho engaro; eriisho ryawe ritarimusaasira.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:35">Lev 19:35</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:5">Amo 8:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu nshaho yaawe otaritwaramu amabaare g'okurengyesa oburemeezi bumwe, haza kunu nigakiraakirana; <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />n'omu nju yaawe otarigiramu endengo z'okurengyesa obwingi bumwe, haza kunu nizikiraakirana. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kur 20:12</ref>. </char></note> Kureka oryagira amabaare gahikire kandi agarikwinganira kimwe; kandi n'endengo ezihikire kandi ezirikwinganira kimwe nizo origira, obone kuhangaarira omu nsi ei MUKAMA waawe arikukuha; <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:1">Enf 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:6">1 Tes 4:6</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba boona abakora nk'ebyo, boona abakora eby'okutahikiirira, abo n'ebirikunugwa ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:8-16">Kur 17:8-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwijukye oku Abaamaleki baabagizire nimuruga Misri, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />oku baababugaine omu muhanda, bakashanga muruhire, mugwire enshazi, bakaita abantu baanyu abaabaire bataine maani, batsigaire enyima; kandi tibaratiinire Ruhanga. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3">1 Sam 15:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ku ariheza kubahuumuza engamba z'abazigu baanyu ababeehinguririize omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha kukubuura kuba obuhunguzi bwanyu, muryamariraho kimwe eiziina ry'Abaamaleki, rirekye kwijukwa ahansi y'eiguru; mutarikyebwa.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro by'emiganuro n'ebya kimwe kya ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Ku oriba waahikire omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha kuba obuhunguzi, waagikubuura, waagituuramu, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Kur 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:9">Enf 3:9</ref>. </char></note> oryatwara emiganuro y'ebi oyerize omu misiri yaawe byona, ebi orishaaruura omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha, obite omu kiibo, obitware omu mwanya ogu MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aritoorana kugumyamu eiziina rye, <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />ohikye aha munyamurwa oriba ariho omu biro ebyo, omugire oti: Eri izooba nimpamya omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ku mpikire omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire naaraganisa baatatenkuriitwe kugituha. <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Ogwo munyamurwa akwakiire ekyo kiibo, akite ahansi omu maisho g'eitambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:5">Kut 28:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:12">Hos 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:22">Bir 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:23-25">Kur 2:23-25</ref>. </char></note> Naiwe oryagarukamu ogambire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, oti: Tatenkuru akaba ari Omuaramu, ari haihi kufa; bwanyima yaashuuma Misri n'abantu bakye, baashuhuukirayo; yaahindukirayo eihanga rikuru, ry'amaani, kandi ery'abantu baingi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Abanyamisri baatwita kubi, baatubonabonesa, baatukoresa emirimo y'obuhuuku. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Twatakira MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baatatenkuriitwe, yaatuhurira, yaareeba okubonabona kwaitu, n'okufa kubi kwaitu n'okuhatwa kwaitu; <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:34">Bir 4:34</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima MUKAMA yaatwiha omuri Misri n'omukono gw'amaani kandi ogubangire, n'ebirikutiinisa munonga, n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza; <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> yaatureeta omu mwanya ogu, yaatuha egi nsi y'amate n'obwoki. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Mbwenu MUKAMA, reeba ndeetsire emiganuro y'ebyezire omu misiri ei wampaire. Bwanyima okite ahansi omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, oramize omu maisho ge, <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:18-20">Mub 5:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:46">Byak 2:46</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 2:47">47</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:17">1 Tim 6:17</ref>. </char></note> oshemerererwe ebirungi byona ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akuhaire n'eka yaawe, iwe n'Omuleevi n'omunyaihanga, abatwire naimwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:24">Kub 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriheza kwiha kimwe kya ikumi ahari byona ebi oyerize omu mwaka gwa kashatu nigwo mwaka gw'okuheeramu kimwe kya ikumi, bwanyima okihe Omuleevi n'omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi, kuriira owaawe, bahaagye; <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />kandi ogambire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe oti: Nyihire omu ka yangye ebintu ebishoroirwe, naabiha Omuleevi, omunyaihanga, efuuzi, n'omufaakazi, nk'ebiragiro byawe byona ebi wandagiire oku biri; omu biragiro byawe byona tihaine ki nshobize, nari eki nyebirwe. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:4">Hos 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Tindabiriireho ndi omu rufu; tihariho bi naihireho nsiisikaire; kandi tihariho bi naagaburiire emizimu y'abafiire; kureka nkahurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, naakora ebi wandagiire byona. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:26">2 Bus 6:26</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 6:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Isa 57:15</ref>. </char></note> Naga amaisho ahansi nooyema omu iguru, omu mwanya gwawe ogurikwera, ohe abantu baawe Israeli omugisha, kandi n'ensi ei waatuhaire ogihe omugisha, ensi y'amate n'obwoki, nk'oku waarahiire nooraganisa baatatenkuriitwe.<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />Eri izooba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu naabaragiira kworobera ebiragiro ebi ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe; n'ahabw'ekyo muryaguma muteho omutima kubyorobera n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:14">Zab 48:14</ref>. </char></note> Eri izooba mwagamba nimuhamya ku MUKAMA ari Ruhanga waanyu, kandi ku murikwija kugyendera omu mihanda ye, n'okukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebyatairweho n'ebyaragiirwe, kandi n'okuhurira eiraka rye. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eri izooba MUKAMA yaagamba naahamya ku muri eihanga rye eri yaayetooraniire, nk'oku yaabaraganiise, kandi ku muriguma nimworobera ebiragiro bye, <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 148:14">Zab 148:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:12">Isa 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char></note> n'oku aribatunguura okukira agandi mahanga goona agu yaahangire, mukagakiza okusiimwa n'okurangaanwa n'ekitiinisa, naimwe mube abantu abeereziibwe MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku yaagambire.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Amabaare mahango agarihandiikwaho eby'emigisha n'eby'emikyeeno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Musa n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli baaragiira abantu nibagira bati: Mukwate ebiragiro byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:1">Yos 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha izooba eri muryambukiraho Yorudani kutaaha omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha, muryabyara amabaare mahango, mugasiigye einoni, <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />mugahandiikyeho ebigambo byona eby'ebiragiro ebi, ku muriheza kwambuka n'okutaaha omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu arikubaha, ensi y'amate n'obwoki, nka MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baashwenkuriimwe, oku yaabaraganiise. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:30-32">Yos 8:30-32</ref>. </char></note> Ku muriheza kwambuka Yorudani, ago mabaare agu naabaragiira eri izooba, muryagabyara aha rushozi Ebali, mugasiigye einoni. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Kandi okwo niyo muryombekyera MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu eitambiro ry'amabaare; mutarigabaizisa ekyoma kyona. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Eryo itambiro rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu muryaryombekyesa amabaare agatabaizire; kandi muritambirireho MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebitambo by'okwotsya; <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />kandi muhongye empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, muriireyo; mushemerererwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Kandi muryahandiika ahari ago mabaare ebigambo byona eby'ebi biragiro, bihwezibwe gye.<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Musa n'abanyamurwa Abaleevi baagambira Abaisraeli boona bati: Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, muhuname, muhurire. Eri izooba mwahinduka eihanga rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Nikyo mushemerereire kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mukoorobera ebiragiro bye n'ebyatairweho, ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba.<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Musa yaayehanangiriza abantu eryo izooba, naagira ati: <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Bir 11:29</ref>. </char></note> Ku muriheza kwambuka Yorudani, aba nibo baryemerera aha rushozi Gerizimu okushabira abantu omugisha; ab'oruganda rwa Simeoni, orwa Leevi, orwa Yuda, orwa Isakaari, orwa Yosefu n'orwa Benyamiini; <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />kandi aba nibo baryemerera aha rushozi Ebali ahabw'okukyeena; ab'oruganda rwa Reubeeni, orwa Gaadi, orwa Asheri, orwa Zebuluuni, orwa Daani n'orwa Nafutaali.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 8:33">Yos 8:33</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:11">Dan 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abaleevi baryagambira Abaisraeli boona n'eiraka rihango, nibagira bati:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kur 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:9">Isa 44:9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:2">Hos 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu orikora ekishushani ekibaizire nari ekiheesirwe, eki MUKAMA ayangira kimwe, ekikozirwe omunyamwoga, akakyemereza bwesherekye, akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />Orikugaya ishe nari nyina akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 22:28">Enf 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwirizayo ekiti ky'omwatano gwa mutaahi we akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:14">Lev 19:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 28:10">Enf 28:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikuhabya empumi, akagiiha omu muhanda akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:5">Mal 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwita orubanja rw'omunyaihanga, orw'efuuzi n'orw'omufaakazi akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 5:1">1 Kor 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikubyama na muka ishe akyeenwe, ahabw'okuba naaba ajwekire ishe busha. Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />Orikubyama n'enyamaishwa yoona akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />Orikubyama na munyaanya owa ishe nari owa nyina akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />Orikubyama na nyina-zaara akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lev 24:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwita mutaahi we bwesherekye akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:3">Bir 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikurya enguzi kwita otaine rubanja akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:3">Yer 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otarikuhamya bigambo by'ebiragiro ebi omu kubikora akyeenwe! Abantu boona baikirize nibagira bati: Amiina.<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Emigisha y'okworoba n'emikyeeno y'okutooroba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:26">Kur 15:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:16">Yer 12:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oryezirika kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, waataho omutima kworobera ebiragiro bye byona ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryakutunguura okukira amahanga goona ag'omu nsi; <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />kandi ku oryorobera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, emigisha egi yoona eryaija ekuhikyeho.<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Oryagira omugisha omu rurembo, kandi ogugire n'omu misiri. <verse eid="DEU 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 4:8">1 Tim 4:8</ref>. </char></note> Oryagira omugisha omu ruzaaro rwawe, n'omu bi oyerize omu misiri yaawe, n'omu by'amatungo gaawe, okukanya kw'ente zaawe n'okuzaara kw'amasyo gaawe g'embuzi n'ag'entaama. <verse eid="DEU 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Omugisha gube aha kitenga kyawe n'aha nyungu yaawe egoya. <verse eid="DEU 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 121:8">Zab 121:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:10">Enf 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:10">Bir 15:10</ref>. </char></note> Oryagira omugisha omu magyenda n'omu magaruka. <verse eid="DEU 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />MUKAMA aryareetera abazigu baawe abariimuka kukurwanisa kukuhunga; baryareetwa omuhanda gumwe baizire kukurwanisa; omu kukuhunga bagabe ebirari mushanju. <verse eid="DEU 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />MUKAMA aryaragiira omugisha gukwijeho, guze omu bitara byawe n'ahari byona ebi orikora n'emikono yaawe; kandi akuheere omugisha omu nsi ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuha. <verse eid="DEU 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:26">Isa 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:12">62:12</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku orikwata ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, waagyendera omu mihanda ye, aryakuhamya obe eihanga eririkwera eri yaayetooraniire, nk'oku yaarahiire naakuraganisa. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Kandi amahanga goona ag'omu nsi garyareeba ku oyetereirwe eiziina rya MUKAMA, gakutiine. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:22">Enf 10:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA aryakutungisa, ogogyerere omu ruzaaro rwawe n'omu by'amatungo gaawe n'omu bi oryeza omu misiri yaawe omu nsi, ei MUKAMA yaaraganiise baashwenkuru naarahira kugikuha. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />MUKAMA aryakwigurira eibiikiro rye erirungi, niryo iguru, agwisize ensi yaawe enjura omu bunaku bwayo, ahe omugisha ebi orikora n'emikono yaawe byona; oryaguza amahanga maingi, kwonka iwe torigeeguzaho. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />MUKAMA aryakuhindura omutwe, ti mukira; oryaguma nootunguuka, torigaruka hansi, ku oryorobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, waataho omutima kubikwata; <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:2">2 Bag 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 4:27">Enf 4:27</ref>. </char></note> otaateishuka kureka ekigambo na kimwe ahari ebyo ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, okatoora aha mukono gwa buryo nari aha gwa bumosho, okukuratira baaruhanga abandi kubaheereza.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:11">Dan 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:2">Mal 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:8">Rom 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 2:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku oryanga kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, otaataho mutima kworobera ebiragiro bye byona n'ebyatairweho, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, egi mikyeeno yoona eryaija, ekuhikyeho. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Oryaba okyeenirwe omu rurembo, kandi n'omu misiri. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Omukyeeno gube aha kitenga kyawe n'aha nyungu yaawe egoya. <verse eid="DEU 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Oryaba okyeenirwe omu ruzaaro rwawe, n'omu bi oyerize omu misiri yaawe, n'omu kukanya kw'ente zaawe, n'okuzaara kw'amasyo gaawe g'entaama n'ag'embuzi. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Oryaba okyeenirwe omu magyenda n'omu magaruka.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:33">Enf 3:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:16">Zab 80:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aryakwoherereza omukyeeno, omunyangararo, n'okuburaaburirwa omuri byona ebi orikwenda kukora, okuhitsya obu orihwerekyerera, okarahuka kuhwaho, naakutura ebibi ebi oriba okozire omu kumwimuura. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:25">Lev 26:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:10">Yer 24:10</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryakureetera orufu rukugumeho, okuhitsya obu arikumaraho omu nsi ei orikuza kukubuura. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />MUKAMA aryakurwaza omunywengyerero n'omushwija n'obuzimba oburikuhurura n'okubabiirirwa, kandi akwitse omushana, n'okubabuka n'okusya-nyamwenga omu bi ohingire; biryakukurata okuhitsya obu orihwerekyerera. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Eiguru eriri ahaiguru yaawe riryaba nk'emiringa, kandi eitaka eri oyemereireho ribe nk'ekyoma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Omu mwanya gw'okugwisa enjura omu nsi yaawe, MUKAMA aryagwisa omucuucu n'omusheenyi; biryaruga omu iguru, bikugweho okuhitsya obu orihwerekyerera.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:30">Bir 32:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:17">Isa 30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aryabareetera okubingwa abazigu baanyu; muryatoora omuhanda gumwe, mwizire kubarwanisa; omu kubahunga mugabe ebirari mushanju; muryatwarwa oku n'oku omu bugabe bwona obw'omu nsi. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Emitumbi yaanyu eryariibwa amahungu goona ag'omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa z'omu nsi, zibure kubinga. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:9">Kur 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:26">15:26</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 5:6">1 Sam 5:6</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabarwaza ebihuute bya Misri n'ebishebe n'efumbi n'obuhere ebi mutarikira. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />MUKAMA aryakugwisa eiraro, akuhumye, akuhunguture omutima. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Oryagyenda noobandagira nyomushana, nk'oku empumi egyenda neebandagira omu mwirima; torigira mugisha omu bi orikora byona; oryaguma oitwe kubi, kandi onyagwe obutoosha, obure kijuna. <verse eid="DEU 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:10">Yer 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Oryagamba omwishiki obugyenyi, ondiijo abyame nawe; oryayombeka enju, torigitaahamu; oryabyara emizaabibu, obure kurya ebijuma byayo. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ente yaawe eryakubaagirwa omu maisho, torigiryaho. Endogoya yaawe eryanyagisibwa amaani noogireeba, torigigarurirwa. Entaama zaawe baryaziha abazigu baawe, obure owaakuha emikono. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Batabani baawe na bahara baawe baryaheebwa ab'erindi ihanga; obakuratse amaisho, gagwe omu nkiro ahabw'obusaasi eizooba ryona; haza iwe obure obushoboorozi bw'okukizibira. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:5">Bar 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:17">Yer 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka y'omu misiri yaawe n'ebi waahendekyeire byona biryariibwa eihanga eri otarikumanya; oryaba ow'okwitwa kubi kwonka, ogume noohondagurwa; <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />ekirirugamu ogwisibwe eiraro ebi amaisho gaawe garireeba. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />MUKAMA aryabarwaza ebihuute ebirikuhurura munonga, ebitarikutambwa, aha maju n'aha maguru, okwiha aha mara g'ebigyere okuhitsya aha kazingiro k'eishokye.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:13">Yer 16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe n'omugabe waanyu ou muriba mwemekire, MUKAMA aryabatwara omu ihanga eri mutakamanyaga n'obu baakuba baashwenkuriimwe; muheererezeyo baaruhanga abandi ab'ebiti n'ab'amabaare. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:9">Yer 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:14">Zab 44:14</ref>. </char></note> Muryahinduka eky'okutangaarira, eky'okucweraho enfumu n'eky'okugaaniiza omu mahanga goona agu MUKAMA aribatwaramu. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mik 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:6">Hag 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Muryabiba embibo nyingi, mushaaruure bikye; ahabw'okuba biryariibwa enzigye. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Muryabyara emizaabibu, mugihingirire, kwonka timurinywa hari viinyo yaayo, n'obu kwakuba okushoroma ebijuma byayo; ahabw'okuba eryariibwa obukooko. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Muryagira emizeituuni omu nsi yaanyu yoona, kwonka timuryesiiga amajuta gaayo; ahakuba emizeituuni yaanyu eryaragaza ebijuma byayo bitakeezire. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:28">Yer 52:28</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:5">Tonz 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Muryazaara aboojo n'abaishiki; kwonka tibariba baanyu, ahabw'okuba baryatwarwa omu bunyagwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Emiti yaanyu yoona n'emyaka y'omu misiri yaanyu biryaba eby'enzigye. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Abanyamahanga abariba bari omuriimwe baryaguma nibeeyongyera kutunguuka, babakire, haza imwe mugume nimweyongyera kugaruka ahansi. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Baryabaguza, kwonka imwe timuribaguza; baryaba omutwe, haza imwe mube omukira. <verse eid="DEU 28:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Emikyeeno egyo yoona eryabaizira, egume ebahiigye, ebahikyeho okuhitsya obu murihwerekyerera, ahabw'okuba muryaba mwangire kuhurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, okukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebyatairweho, ebi yaabaragiire; <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 5:15">Ezk 5:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi egyo mikyeeno eryabahikaho, imwe na baijukuru baanyu, kuba akamanyiso n'eky'okutangaaza ebiro byona.<verse eid="DEU 28:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 9:35-37">Neh 9:35-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba mukanga kuheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'omutima ogurikwesiima kandi ogushemereirwe, nimusiima Ruhanga ahabw'ebintu byona ebi yaabakanyisiize, bikashaagirirana; <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:12">Yer 27:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref>. </char></note> nikyo muriheerereza abazigu baanyu, abu MUKAMA aryohereza kubarwanisa, mwine enjara n'eiriho, mutaine ky'okujwara, kandi mukyenire ebintu byona; kandi aryabata enkomo y'ekyoma omu bitsya, okuhitsya obu aribahwerekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:15">Yer 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:43">Luk 19:43</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:19">Tonz 4:19</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabareetera eihanga rya hare, ariihe aha muheru gw'ensi, riije nirirahuka nk'empungu, eihanga eri oriba otarikumanya rurimi rwaryo, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:23">Dan 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17">2 Bus 36:17</ref>. </char></note> eriine ahamaisho harikutiinisa, eritaryeta ha bagurusi, n'obu kwakuba okusaasira abaana; <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:7">Isa 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:15-17">Yer 5:15-17</ref>. </char></note> baryarya ebi amatungo gaanyu garizaara, n'ebi emisiri yaanyu eryeza, okuhitsya obu murihwerekyerera. Kandi tibaribatsigira ngano yoona, nari viinyo, nari amajuta, nari okukanya kw'ente zaanyu, n'obu kwakuba okuzaara kw'amasyo g'entaama zaanyu n'ag'embuzi, okuhitsya obu baribahwerekyereza. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryabagotera omu ndembo zaanyu zoona, okuhitsya obu engo zaanyu z'amabaare ndaingwa kandi ezigumire, ezi mwabaire nimwesiga omu nsi yaanyu yoona, zirikumbagara; baryabagotera omu ndembo zaanyu zoona omu nsi yaanyu yoona ei MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu abahaire. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:28">2 Bag 6:28</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 6:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:9">Yer 19:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryarya abaana baanyu abu mwezaariire, enyama ya batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu, abu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ariba abahaire, ahabw'okugotwa n'okutagira bwehigiro, oku abazigu bariba babafundize. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Kandi omushaija omutetsi kandi omwegiragye aryagira eriisho ribi aha murumuna, aha mukazi we w'aha mukono, n'aha mwana we ou ariba atsigaize, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />arekye kuha n'omwe aharibo aha nyama z'abaana be abu ariba naarya; ahabw'okuba aryaba atakiine ki atsigaize ahabw'okugotwa n'okubura obwehigiro, oku abazigu baanyu bariba babafundize omu ndembo zaanyu zoona. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Kandi n'omukazi, oriba ari omuriimwe, omutetsi kandi omwegiragye, owaabaire atenda kigyere kye kuhika ahansi ahabw'obutetsi n'obwegiragye, nawe aryagira eriisho ribi ahari iba, aha mutabani n'ahari muhara we, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:10">Tonz 4:10</ref>. </char></note> abaime ekyanyima ekiriba kimuri omu maguru, n'abaana abu ariba azaire; ahabw'okuba aryabarya bwesherekye ahabw'okukyena ebintu byona, ahabw'okugotwa n'okubura obwehigiro oku abazigu baanyu bariba babafundize omu ndembo zaanyu zoona.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:58: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:3">Kur 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:14">Mal 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:18">Zab 83:18</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muriba mutataireho mutima kuhurira ebigambo by'ebiragiro ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki, mukatiina eiziina eri ery'ekitiinisa kandi eririkutiinisa, MUKAMA RUHANGA WAAWE; <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:59: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:12-15">2 Bus 21:12-15</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabareetera, imwe na baijukuru baanyu, okubonabonesibwa okutakareebwaga, okurimara omwanya muhango, n'endwara ezirikusaasa, zibabeho akarande; <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />kandi abagarureho endwara zoona eza Misri, ezi mwabaire mutiina, zibagumeho. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Kandi ezindi ndwara n'ezindi nfu zoona, ezitahandiikirwe mu kitabo ky'ebiragiro ebi, nazo MUKAMA aryazibarwaza, okuhitsya obu murihwerekyerera. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Muryatsigara bakye, haza mwabaire muri baingi nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, ahabw'okutahurira iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="DEU 28:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:63: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 3:17">Zef 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:26">Enf 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaire abashemerererwa omu kubakora gye n'okubakanyisa, nikwo MUKAMA aribashemerererwa omu kubacwekyereza n'okubamaraho; muryasikurwa, mwihwe omu nsi, ei murikuzamu kukubuura. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:13">Yer 16:13</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabataataanisiza omu mahanga goona, okuruga aha muheru gw'ensi okuhika aha gundi; kandi oryaheererezayo baaruhanga abandi ab'ebiti n'ab'amabaare, abu mwabaire mutakamanyaga, n'obu baakuba baashwenkuriimwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa 57:21</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:4">Amo 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:36">Lev 26:36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ago mahanga timurigagiriramu busingye, n'obu kwakuba okubona ah'okuhuumuza ekigyere; kureka MUKAMA aryabaheerayo omutima gurikutetema, n'amaisho agagwire omu nkiro, kandi n'omutima ogwitsirwe orushusho; <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />amagara gaanyu garyatuura omu kubanganisa, mugire obwoba nyomushana na nyekiro; timurigira ky'okuhamizaho yaaba muri ab'okugumaho. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:67: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 7:4">Yob 7:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'eby'okutiinisa ebi emitima yaanyu eriba neetiina, n'ebi amaisho gaanyu gariba nigareeba, ku burisheesha, muryagira muti: Kuri bwizire! Kandi ku buriira, mugire muti: Kuri buseesire! <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:68: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:3">Hos 9:3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryabagarura Misri n'emeeri, omu muhanda ogu naabaire naabagambiire nti: Timurigaruka kugutoora. Okwo muryayetundirayo aha bazigu baanyu, kuba abahuuku n'abazaana; kwonka tihaine oribagura.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okwehanangiriza n'okuhana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Ebi nibyo bigambo by'endagaano, ei MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa kuragaana n'Abaisraeli omu nsi ya Moabu, ebyayongyeirwe aha ndagaano ei yaaraganiire nabo aha rushozi Horebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa yaayeta Abaisraeli boona yaabagira ati: Mukareeba byona ebi MUKAMA yaakozire Faraho n'abaheereza be boona n'ensi ye yoona omu nsi ya Misri, omu maisho gaanyu, <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />n'ebigyezo by'amaani n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza bikuru, ebi mwayereebeire. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:17">Isa 63:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:43">Yoh 8:43</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom 11:8</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA takabahaire mutima gw'okwetegyereza, nari amaisho g'okureeba, nari amatu g'okuhurira n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2">Bir 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Nkamara emyaka makumi ana nimbeebembera omu ihamba; ebijwaro byanyu tibikabakuriireho, n'enkaito tizikabakuriire mu bigyere. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Timukaryaga mugaati n'obu kwakuba okunywa viinyo nari eby'okunywa ebirikusinza, ngu mubone kumanya ku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:23">Kub 21:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku mwahikire omu mwanya ogu, Sihooni omugabe wa Heshibooni na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani baahurura kuturwanisa, twabasingura; <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Kub 32:33</ref>. </char></note> twanyaga ensi yaabo, twagiha Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase kuba obuhunguzi bwabo. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:3">1 Bag 2:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mukwate ebigambo by'endagaano egi, mubihitsye, mubone kutunga omugisha omu bi murikukora byona.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Eri izooba mwena mwemereire omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, abeebembezi b'enganda zaanyu, abakuru baanyu, abategyeki baanyu, abashaija boona ba Israeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:21">Yos 9:21</ref>. </char></note> abaana baanyu abato, abakazi baanyu n'abanyamahanga abari omu nsiisira zaanyu, okuruga aha barikubasheenyera enku okuhika aha barikubatahira amaizi, <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />mureetsirwe kutaaha omu ndagaano ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ei yaahamize naarahira, kandi ei arikuragaana naimwe eri izooba; <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />abone kubahamya eri izooba kuba eihanga rye, nawe akaba Ruhanga waanyu, nk'oku yaabagambiire, kandi nk'oku yaarahiire naaraganisa baashwenkuriimwe, Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Yer 31:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tiimwe mwenka abari aha abu ndikuragaana nabo egi ndagaano n'endahiro, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:39">Byak 2:39</ref>. </char></note> kureka n'abatari aha naitwe eri izooba, otaihiremu abari aha, abeemereire naitwe omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Nimumanya oku twatwire omu nsi ya Misri, kandi n'oku twarabire omu mahanga agu mwarabiremu; <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />mukareeba ebirikunugwa byabo n'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, eby'ebiti, eby'amabaare, eby'efeeza, n'eby'ezaabu, ebyabaire biri omuribo. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:15">Heb 12:15</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde, omuriimwe hatarigira omushaija nari omukazi nari omuryango nari oruganda, ou omutima gwe gwateishuka gukaruga ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, akaza kuheereza baaruhanga ab'ago mahanga, kandi hatarigira omuriimwe owaamerwamu omuzi ogurikwana ebyana ebirikushaarira nk'omuravunga; <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:1">Isa 30:1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:19">Efe 4:19</ref>. </char></note> akihurira ebigambo by'endagaano egi, akeehimbisa omu mutima gwe, naagira ati: Tiinyine ku ndiba, n'obu ndigumizamu n'obugangaazi bw'omutima gwangye; atyo akareetera ababisi n'aboomire kucwekyerera. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:7">Ezk 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:33">Kur 32:33</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ogwo MUKAMA tarimusaasira, kureka ekiniga kya MUKAMA n'eihato rye biryamwakaho nk'omuriro omuri obwo bunaku, emikyeeno yoona ehandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo emubeho, kandi MUKAMA aryamaraho eiziina rye, ryebe ahansi y'eiguru. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:51">Mat 24:51</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryamutoorana omu nganda za Israeli zoona abe engwerwakagwe, nk'emikyeeno yoona ey'omu ndagaano ehandiikirwe omu kitabo eki eky'ebiragiro oku eri. <verse eid="DEU 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Kandi ab'obusingye oburiija, nibo baana baanyu abarikurataho, n'omunyaihanga oriruga omu nsi ya hare, baryataka ku barireeba ebibonaboneso by'ensi egyo n'endwara ezi MUKAMA agireetsireho, <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:34">Zab 107:34</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:9">Zef 2:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku egyo nsi yoona ehindukire obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, n'omwonyo, n'eitaka erihiire nyamwenga, eritarikuhingwa, eritarikwera, n'obu kwakuba okumerwaho akanyaatsi, ecwekyereziibwe nka Sodoma, Gomora, Aduma na Zeboimu, ei MUKAMA yaagiriire ekiniga, akagicwekyereza agigwereirwe kubi; <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">1 Bag 9:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:9">9</ref>. </char></note> kandi buzima n'amahanga goona garyabuuza gati: Ahabw'enki MUKAMA agizire ati egi nsi? Eki kiniga kingi nikimanyisa ki? <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Abantu baryabagarukamu nibagira bati: Ahabw'okuba bakareka endagaano ya MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo, ei yaaragaine nabo, obu yaabaiha omu nsi ya Misri; <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />baagyenda, baaheereza baaruhanga abandi, abu baabaire batarikumanya, kandi abu MUKAMA yaabaire atabahaire, baabaramya. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:11">Dan 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyakiire ahari egi nsi, kikagireetera emikyeeno yoona eyaahandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:20">2 Bus 7:20</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo kyareeteire MUKAMA kubabiihirirwa, okubagwerwa kubi n'okubagirira ekiniga kingi, akabarandura omu nsi yaabo, akabanaga omu nsi endiijo, nk'oku kiri hati.<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:6">Yob 11:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 11:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:7">Byak 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:16">2 Tim 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'emibonano n'ebya MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, kwonka ebishuurwirwe n'ebyaitu n'oruzaaro rwaitu ebiro byona, ngu tubone kworobera ebigambo byona eby'ebiragiro ebi.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhikiiriza ebi yaaraganiise ahabw'okumworobera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 18:28">Ezk 18:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:17">Luk 15:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona ku biriheza kubabaho, eby'emigisha n'eby'emikyeeno, ebi naataire omu maisho gaanyu, mwabiijukira omu mahanga goona, agu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ariba ababingiiremu, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />mwagaruka ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mwahurira eiraka rye, mwakora ebyo byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba, imwe n'abaana baanyu, mwabikora n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona; <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:14">Yer 29:14</ref>. </char></note> obwo MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryagarura abantu baanyu abaanyagirwe, abagirire esaasi, agarukye abateeranire hamwe, abaihe omu mahanga goona, agu MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu yaabataataanisiizemu. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Abantu baanyu ababingirwe, n'obu bariba bari aha muheru gw'ensi, MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryabataruura, abaiheyo; <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />kandi aryabagarura omu nsi eyaabaire eri eya baashwenkuriimwe, mugizemu ebe eyaanyu; abagirire gye, abakanyise mukire baashwenkuriimwe obwingi. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryashara ekishushu ky'aha mitima yaanyu n'ey'oruzaaro rwanyu, mukunde MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona, mubone kugumaho. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryata egyo mikyeeno yoona aha bazigu baanyu n'aha barikubanga boona bakabahiiga. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Kandi muryagaruka muhurire eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mworobere ebiragiro bye byona ebi ndikubaragiira eri izooba. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:27">Ezk 34:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:41">Yer 32:41</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:17">Zef 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:6">Luk 15:6</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 15:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 15:32">32</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu aryabaha omugisha, abagogyeze omu bi murikukora byona, oruzaaro rwanyu, okuzaara kw'amatungo gaanyu n'emyaka y'omu misiri yaanyu, mube gye; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aryagaruka abashemerererwe omu kubagogyeza, nk'oku yaabaire ashemerererwa baashwenkuriimwe, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />ku murihurira eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mwakwata ebiragiro bye n'ebyatairweho, ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki eky'ebiragiro, kandi ku murigaruka ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu n'omutima gwanyu gwona n'amagara gaanyu goona.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Ahakuba ekiragiro eki, eki ndikukuragiira eri izooba, tikirikukurema, n'obu kwakuba okukuba hare. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6-8">Rom 10:6-8</ref>. </char></note> Tikiri mu iguru, iwe okugira oti: N'oha oritemba omu iguru, akakitureetera, ngu tukihurire, tukyorobere? <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Kandi tikiri seeri y'enyanja, iwe okugira oti: N'oha oritwambukirayo, akakitureetera, ngu tukihurire, tukyorobere? <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Kureka ekyo kigambo kikuri haihi munonga omu kanwa kaawe n'omu mutima gwawe, ngu obaase kukyorobera.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu oku bashemereire kwetooranira eby'emigisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:26">Bir 11:26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:16">Mak 16:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, eri izooba naata omu maisho gaawe amagara n'ebirungi, kandi okufa n'ebibi. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ku oryorobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, ebi ndikukuragiira eri izooba, okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, okugyendera omu mihanda ye, n'okukwata ebiragiro bye n'ebi yaataireho n'ebi yaaragiire, obwo oryagumaho, okanye, kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe aryakuheera omugisha omu nsi ei orikuza kukubuura. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Kwonka omutima gwawe ku guriteishuka, waayanga kuhurira, waabeihwabeihwa, waaramya baaruhanga abandi, waabaheereza, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:26">Bir 4:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:15">Yos 23:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 23:16">16</ref>. </char></note> nimbagambirira kimwe eri izooba, muryahwerekyerera, timurihangaarira mu nsi, ei murikuza kwambuka Yorudani kuza kukubuura. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Eri izooba niinyeta eiguru n'ensi kubashinja, ku naata omu maisho gaanyu amagara n'okufa, omugisha n'omukyeeno; n'ahabw'ekyo mutoorane amagara, mubone kugumaho, imwe n'oruzaaro rwanyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:10">Yob 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:25">Yoh 11:25</ref>. </char></note> okukunda MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, okuhurira eiraka rye, n'okumuhamiraho,–ahabw'okuba niwe magara gaanyu n'okuhangaara kwanyu, mubone kuguma omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baashwenkuriimwe, Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuragana kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Musa yaagyenda, yaagambira Abaisraeli boona ebigambo ebi. <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:7">Kur 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:12">Kub 20:12</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Eri izooba naahitsya emyaka igana na makumi abiri; tinkibaasa kushohora n'okutaaha; kandi MUKAMA akangira ati: Toryambuka Yorudani egi. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:3">Bir 9:3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe aribeebembera kwambuka, kandi niwe arihwerekyereza amahanga ago omu maisho gaanyu, mukagakubuura; kandi Yoshua niwe aribeebembera kwambuka, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:24">Kub 21:24</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA aryagagira, nk'oku yaagizire Sihooni na Ogi, abagabe b'Abaamori, abu yaacwekyereize, n'ensi yaabo. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />MUKAMA aryagahayo omu maisho gaanyu, mugagire nk'ebiragiro byona ebi naabaragiire oku biri. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Zab 118:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yos 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb 13:5</ref>. </char></note> Mube ab'amaani, mugume omutima; mutagira obwoba, kandi mutabatiina; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu niwe arikubeebembera; taribahemukaho, kandi taribatsigaho.<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 1:38">Bir 1:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musa yaayeta Yoshua, yaamugambirira omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona ati: Ba ow'amaani, ogume omutima, ahakuba oryagyenda n'abantu aba omu nsi ei MUKAMA yaarahiire kuha baishenkurubo; kandi niiwe origibahunguza. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA niwe arikukwebembera; aryaguma naiwe, tarikuhemukaho, kandi tarikutsigaho; otatiina, n'obu kwakuba okuhahaaza omutima.<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Musa yaahandiika ebyo biragiro, yaabiha abanyamurwa beene Leevi, abaabaire baheeka eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, n'abakuru b'Abaisraeli boona. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Musa yaabaragiira naagira ati: Aha muheru gwa buri myaka mushanju, omu bunaku obwatairweho omu mwaka gw'okuha obusingye, aha bugyenyi bw'Ensiisira, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:2">2 Bag 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:1">Neh 8:1</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli boona ku bariba baizire kumurikwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omu mwanya ogu aritoorana, oryaguma oshomere ebiragiro ebi omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona, nibabihurira. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Oryateerana abantu, abashaija n'abakazi n'abaana n'abashuhuuki abariba batwire naimwe, babihurire, beegye kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, bateho omutima kworobera ebigambo byona eby'ebi biragiro, <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:2">Bir 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:6">Zab 78:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 78:7">7</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'abaana baabo, abatakabimanyaga, babihurire, beegye kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu ebiro byona ebi murimara omu nsi, ei murikwambuka Yorudani kuza kukubuura.<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okugambira Musa eby'okufa kwe, n'ebiriba aha Baisraeli bwanyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Reeba, obunaku bw'okufa kwawe buri haihi; yeta Yoshua, mwije mweyorekye omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, mbone kumukwatsa omurimo. Musa na Yoshua baagyenda, baayemurika omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />MUKAMA yaayeyoreka omuri eryo Ihema, ari omu nyomyo y'ekicu, kandi egyo nyomyo y'ekicu yaayemerera ahaiguru y'omuryango gwaryo.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:31-33">1 Bag 11:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:13">Yer 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Reeba, noija kufa, oshangye baashwenkuru; bwanyima aba bantu baryaimuka, baraaye nibakurata baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga ab'omu nsi, ei barikuza kutuuramu, baanyimuure, baite endagaano yangye ei naaragaine nabo. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">24:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:23">Ezk 30:23</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:13">Bar 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Obwo bunaku ekiniga kyangye kiryabaakaho nk'omuriro, mbarugyeho, mbaime amaisho, bamarweho, bahikweho ebibi bingi n'eminyangararo; n'ahabw'ebyo omu bunaku obwo baryagira bati: Ekitureeteire kuhikwaho ebibi ebi, t'ahabw'okuba Ruhanga tari muriitwe? <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Buzimazima omu bunaku obwo ndyabaima amaisho, mbature ebibi byona ebi bariba bakozire, omu kwehongyera baaruhanga abandi. <verse eid="DEU 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo muhandiikye ekyeshongoro eki, iwe okyegyese Abaisraeli, kandi okibeeshongoze, kimbeere obujurizi bw'okushinja Abaisraeli; <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:26">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:6">Hos 13:6</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ku ndiheza kubahitsya omu nsi ei naarahiire kuha baishenkurubo, ensi y'amate n'obwoki, baaheza kurya n'okuhaaga, baagomoka, baryayehongyera baaruhanga abandi, babakorere, bangaye, baite endagaano yangye. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:24">Yoh 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:25">Amo 5:25</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku barihikwaho ebibi bingi n'eminyangararo, ekyeshongoro eki kiryaba mushinja w'okuhamya omu maisho gaabo, ahabw'okuba tikiryeba, kiryaguma nikyeshongorwa oruzaaro rwabo. Ahakuba nimmanya ebiteekateeko byabo, ebi baine na hati, ntakabahikize mu nsi ei naarahiire kubaha.<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Atyo Musa yaahandiika ekyeshongoro ekyo ahari eryo izooba, yaakyegyesa Abaisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:6">Yos 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaayehanangiriza Yoshua mwene Nuuni, naagira ati: Ba ow'amaani, ogume omutima, ahakuba niiwe orihitsya Abaisraeli omu nsi ei naarahiire kubaha; kandi ndyaguma naiwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa ku yaaherize kuhandiika ebigambo by'ebyo biragiro omu kitabo, yaabimariramu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />yaaragiira Abaleevi abaabaire baheeka eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, naagira ati: <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:9">1 Bag 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:8">2 Bag 22:8</ref>. </char></note> Mwakiire eki kitabo ky'ebiragiro, mukite aha rubaju rw'eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, kigume kiri omujurizi w'okubashinja. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:24">Bir 9:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimmanya obugomi bwanyu n'ebitsya byanyu ebigangaire. Reeba, eri izooba mwagomera MUKAMA nkibaine; kaashwa ku ndiba naafiire, muryashura ki? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:19">Bir 30:19</ref>. </char></note> Munteeranire abakuru b'enganda zaanyu boona n'abategyeki baanyu, mbone kugamba ebigambo ebi, babihurire, n'okweta eiguru n'ensi kubashinja. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:19">Bar 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:9">Hos 9:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba nimmanya ngu, ku ndiheza kufa, muryayesiisira kimwe, muteishukye omuhanda ogu naabaragiire; kandi omu biro ebirikurataho muryahikwaho ebibi bingi, ahabw'okuba muryakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, kumugwisa kubi n'ebi murikora n'emikono yaanyu.<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Atyo Musa yaagamba ebigambo by'ekyeshongoro eki, Abaisraeli boona babihuriire, okuhitsya obu yaabiherize.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro kya Musa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Iwe iguru 'we, tega amatu, ngambe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:1">N'ensi ehuriire ebigambo by'omu kanwa kangye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:2">Isa 1:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Eby'okwegyesa byangye nibiija kugwa nk'enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">N'ebigambo byangye bitonde nk'orume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Nk'orutoonyerera aha bunyaatsi bubisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Nk'orujura aha bishaka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:4">2 Sam 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa 55:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Ahakuba naaza kuranga eiziina rya MUKAMA.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:3">Muhamye Ruhanga waitu ku ari mukuru rugambwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Rukiri, omurimo gwe guhikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Ahakuba emitwarize ye yoona n'ey'oburyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Ni Ruhanga ow'okwesigwa, otagira kutahikiirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">N'ow'amazima, kandi ohikiriire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:31">2 Sam 22:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:37">Dan 4:37</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Bamukoreire ebitahikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:5">Tibakiri baana be ahabw'obumogo bwabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:5">N'ab'obusingye oburikwehabagiza kandi obukiikami.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Imwe bashema 'mwe, abataine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Okwo nikwo murikuzimuurira MUKAMA?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Tiwe Shoimwe owaabacungwire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Niwe yaabahangire, akabagumyaho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:16">Isa 63:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:2">Zab 74:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Mwijukye ebiro ebya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Muteekateekye aha myaka y'obusingye bwingi obwa baashwenkuriimwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Mubuuze baashoimwe, nibaija kubibashobororera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Mubuuze abakuru baanyu, nibaija kubibagambira.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Rukira-boona obu yaaha amahanga obuhunguzi bwago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Akataanisa enganda z'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Obwo akataho emyatano y'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">Nk'omubaro gw'Abaisraeli oku gwabaire guri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:8">Kut 11:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Ahakuba abantu ba MUKAMA nigwo mugabo gwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakobo niwe mugabo gw'obuhunguzi bwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Akamushanga omu nsi erimu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Omu ihamba ei enyamaishwa zigambira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Yaamwehinguririza, yaamutaho omutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Yaamurinda nk'emboni y'eriisho rye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:20">Neh 9:20</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 7:2">Enf 7:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Nk'oku empungu esisiimura ebyana byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">Ekaimutsya amapapa ahaiguru yaabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">Ekagajanjamura, ekabitwara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">Ekabiheeka aha mapapa gaayo;<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Nikwo MUKAMA wenka yaamwebembeire atyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:12">Hatariho ruhanga ondiijo w'abanyamahanga owaakwataniise nawe.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Akamutunguura, yaamugyendesa omu myanya y'ahaiguru ey'omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Yaarya aha byezire omu misiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Yaamunyuunyutisa obwoki bw'omu rukiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">N'amajuta omu rukiri orugumire munonga;<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Amate g'ente g'amakamo, n'amate g'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">N'ebishaju by'abaana b'entaama, n'empaya z'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Amasyo ga Bashani g'ente n'ag'embuzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">N'engano ezirikukira oburungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Kandi yaakunywaisa viinyo erikuruga omu shande y'emizaabibu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:28">Mat 26:28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:29">29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Bwanyima Yeshuruuni yaagomoka, yaatera omugyere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">K'ogomokire, okahanguha, okabengyeya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Yaimuura Ruhanga owaamuhangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Yaagaya Rukiri w'okujunwa kwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26">Zab 89:26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Baamwitsa eihari ahari baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:16">Baamukwatsa ekiniga ahabw'ebirikunugwa byabo.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Baatambira baadaimoni, abatari Ruhanga Nyamuhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">Baaruhanga abu batakamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">Baaruhanga abasya, abahangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:17">Abu baashwenkuriimwe baabaire batakamanyaga.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Rukiri owaabakire enda yaawe, toramutaireho mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:18">Waayebwa Ruhanga owaakuzaire.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />MUKAMA yaakireeba, yaabatamirwa kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:19">Ahabw'okwitsibwa ekiniga batabani be na bahara be.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Yaagira ati: Ndyabaima amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Ndeebe omuheru gwabo oku guriba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Ahabw'okuba n'ab'obusingye bw'obugomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">N'abaana abataine bwesigwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Banyitsize eihari aha kitari Ruhanga Nyamuhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Bankwatsize ekiniga n'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Naanye ndyabaitsa eihari aha bantu abatari ihanga buzima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Mbakwatse ekiniga n'eihanga eritaine bwengye;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom 10:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Ahakuba ekiniga kyangye kyakize omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Kandi nigwaka okuhika okuzimu owa Nyamuteza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Nigubuguma omu nsi n'ebigyeziremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Kandi nigwotsya emisingi y'enshozi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:11">Tonz 4:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Ndyabarundaho obubi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:23">Mbamarireho emyambi yangye.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Baryakuuhuzibwa enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Bamarweho ekibabo ky'omuriro n'orufu orurikwita;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Ndyabahayo omu maino g'enyamaishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">N'aha biine obushegu ebirikugyendesa enda omu mucuucu.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Aheeru rurara eryabamaraho abaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">N'omu nju bashangwemu ebirikutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Bicwekyereze abatsigazi n'empangare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Abarikwonka n'abagurusi b'enju.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 1:20">Tonz 1:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nkaagizire nti: Ndyabataataanisa, mbanagye hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:26">Mbamareho, barekye kwijukwa omu bantu,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Kuri ntaratiinire kurahurwa abazigu, bakankwatsa ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">Ngu ababisha baabo barekye kwebeiha nibagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">Emikono yaitu niyo eriho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">MUKAMA tiwe akozire ebi byona.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Ahakuba n'eihanga ry'abantu abatagira naama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:28">Kandi abataine kwetegyereza.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Kuri baabaire baine obwengye, bakaayetegyereize eki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:29">Bateekateeka aha by'omuheru gwabo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 81:13">Zab 81:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Omwe akaabaasize ata kubinga rukumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">N'ababiri okubinga kakumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Kuri Rukiri waabo atarabarekwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Kuri MUKAMA atarabahaireyo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:10">Yos 23:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Ahakuba Rukiri waabo tari nka Rukiri waitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:31">Nangwa n'abazigu baitu ahabwabo nibakihamya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:8">1 Sam 4:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Kandi omuzaabibu gwabo gukakomooka aha gwa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">N'omu misiri ya Gomora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Ebijuma by'emizaabibu yaabo n'endurwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Emitsitsa y'ebijuma byayo neeshaarira;<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Viinyo yaabo n'obushegu bw'ebijoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:33">N'obushegu bw'encwera oburikwita.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Ebyo tibibiikirwe owangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:34">Bikakomwa n'akamanyiso omu mabiikiro gangye?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Okuhoora enzigu n'okwangye, n'okuzimuura n'okwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Omu bunaku obu ebigyere byabo biriterereramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Ahabw'okuba ekiro kyabo eky'okuhikwaho akabi kiri haihi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">N'ekifubiro kyabo kiryarahuka;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:30">Heb 10:30</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Ahakuba MUKAMA ku arireeba abantu be bahweirwemu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Kandi hataine otsigaireho, yaaba muhuuku, nari ow'obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Aryabaihaho orubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Agirire abairu be esaasi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:20">Yer 31:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:14">Yoel 2:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Kandi aryagira ati: Baaruhanga baabo bari nkahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:37">Rukiri waabo ou baayesigire,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:14">Bar 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:28">Yer 2:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Abaabaire barya ebishaju by'ebitambo byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Bakanywa viinyo y'empongano zaabo z'eby'okunywa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Mbwenu nibaimukye, babahwere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Babe nibo baabarinda.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Mureebe hati, Nyowe, Nyowe ekiti, ku ndi We,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Ku hatariho ruhanga ondiijo, kureka Nyowe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Niinye nyita, nkazoora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Kandi niinye mputaaza, nkatamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Tihaine orikubaasa kwiha omu mukono gwangye ou naakwatsire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:4">Isa 41:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:4">46:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:20">Zab 68:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Ahakuba niinyimutsya omukono gwangye ahaiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:40">Nindahira, nk'oku mbaho ebiro byona,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Ku ndityaza rurara yangye erikumurinkana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">Omukono gwangye gwagikwata kucwa emanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">Ndyahoora abazigu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">Nzimuurire abarikuunyanga;<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Emyambi yangye ndyagisinza n'eshagama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">na rurara yangye erye enyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">eshagama y'abaitsirwe n'ey'enkwatwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">okwiha aha bakuru b'abategyeki b'abazigu.<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Imwe mahanga 'mwe, nimusiime abantu be;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Ahakuba aryahoorera eshagama y'abairu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Ahoore abazigu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Kandi ahongyerere ensi y'abantu be.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa yaija, we na Yoshua mwene Nuuni baagamba ebigambo byona eby'ekyo kyeshongoro, abantu babihuriire. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa ku yaaherize kugambira Abaisraeli boona ebyo bigambo byona, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />yaabagira ati: Mute emitima yaanyu aha bigambo byona, ebi naabeehanangiriza eri izooba, mubiragiire abaana baanyu, babone kworobera ebigambo byona eby'ebi biragiro. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Ahakuba okubyorobera ti ky'okufa busha, kureka nigo magara gaanyu, kandi nikyo kiribahaisa okuhangaarira omu nsi ei murikwambuka Yorudani kuza kukubuura.<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Ahari eryo izooba MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />Temba oru rushozi Neebo ya Abariimu orw'omu nsi ya Moabu, orushungaine na Yeriko, oreebe ensi ya Kanaani, ei ndikuha Abaisraeli kuba eyaabo; <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />ofeere ahari orwo rushozi oru waaza kutemba, oshangye abaanyu, nk'oku Arooni mukuru waawe yaafeereire aha rushozi Hoori, akashanga abaabo; <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:11">Kub 20:11</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba mukancumuraho omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, muri aha maizi ga Meriba ahari Kadeshi omu ihamba rya Ziini; kandi timwampaisa kitiinisa omu Baisraeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Noija kureeba egyo nsi ei ndikuha Abaisraeli omu maisho gaawe, kwonka torigihikamu.<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Musa okushabira enganda za Israeli omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:28">Kut 49:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24:50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu nigwo mugisha, ogu Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga yaashabire Abaisraeli, atakafiire. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">MUKAMA akaruga Sinai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Yaabajugutira nk'omushekye, naaruga Seiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Yaayakira aha rushozi Parani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Yaaruga omu bukumi bw'abarikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Omuriro guri aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Kur 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:3">Hab 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Eego, akakunda abantu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Abarikwera be boona bakaba bari omu mukono gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Bashutami aha bigyere bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Nibahurira ebi arikubahabura.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:11">Hos 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:39">Luk 10:39</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa akaturagiira ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:4">Kuba obuhunguzi bw'eihanga rya Yakobo.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Atyo MUKAMA yaaba omukama omuri Yeshuruuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:5">Obu abakuru b'eihanga baateerana hamwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:5">N'enganda za Israeli zoona.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Reubeeni agumeho, arekye kufa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:6">N'abantu be barekye kuba bakye.<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ebi nibyo yaagambire ahari Yuda, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Ai MUKAMA, hurira eiraka rya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Omureete omu bantu be;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Akeerwanirira n'emikono ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Naiwe omuhe emikono kurwanisa abazigu be.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:8">Kut 49:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Ahari Leevi yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Ohe Leevi Tumimu yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Kandi Urimu yaawe ogihe omuntu waawe orikutiina Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Ou waagyereize ahari Maasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Ou waahakanisiize aha maizi ga Meriba;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kur 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kub 27:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Owaagambire ahari ishe na nyina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Ati: Tindikubamanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Akooga beene ishe, kandi ateete aha baana be;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Ahakuba Abaleevi bakoorobera ekigambo kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Baakwata endagaano yaawe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:29">Mak 10:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 2:5">Mal 2:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Baryayegyesa Yakobo eby'oburyo byawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Beegyese na Israeli ebiragiro byawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Baryaguma nibata obubaane omu maisho gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Batambire aha itambiro ryawe ekitambo ky'okwokyeza kimwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:11">Lev 10:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Ai MUKAMA, ogume ohe omugisha ebi atungire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Oikirize ebi arikukora n'emikono ye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Ohondahonde obwezirikiro bw'abarikwimuka kumurwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Kandi n'obw'abarikumwanga, barekye kugaruka kwimuka.<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ahari Benyamiini yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Orikukundwa MUKAMA aryatuura nawe buhooro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Agume naamusangira eizooba ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Obutaaho bwe bube amabega ge.<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ahari Yosefu yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">Ensi ye MUKAMA agihe omugisha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">Gw'eby'obuguzi bwingi eby'ahaiguru omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">N'eby'ahansi okuzimu,<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Ogw'ebijuma by'obuguzi bwingi ebirikwezibwa eizooba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:14">N'ogw'omweru mwingi ogw'emyaka eya buri kwezi,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Ogw'ebintu ebirikukira oburungi ebirikuruga omu nshozi eza ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:15">N'ogw'eby'obuguzi bwingi ebirikuruga omu bibungo ebitahwaho,<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Ogw'eby'obuguzi bwingi eby'omu nsi n'ebigirimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">N'obuganzi ahari Ogwo owaabaire ari omu rushaka ruri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Emigisha egyo eze aha mutwe gwa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Aha kazingiro k'ogwo owaashoroirwe omuri beene ishe, akaba omutegyeki waabo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Kur 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:4">4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Enimi ye y'omujigaijo ekitiinisa n'ekyayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Amahembe gaayo n'ag'embogo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Eryagabingisa amahanga goona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Gahikye aha muheru gw'ensi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ago mahembe nibwo bukumi bwingi bwa Efuraimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">N'enkumi nyingi za Manaase.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:5">Zab 44:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Ahari Zebuluuni yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">Iwe Zebuluuni, oyesiimire amagyenda gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">Naiwe Isakaari, oyesiimire amahema gaawe.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Baryayeta amahanga, gaije aha rushozi rwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Batambireyo ebitambo by'abahikiriire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Ahakuba banyuunyuuta ebintu bingi ebirikuruga omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">N'eby'obutungi ebitarikumanywa ebiri omu musheenyi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">Isa 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 4:5">Zab 4:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ahari Gaadi yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Orikuhangusya Gaadi aheebwe omugisha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Gaadi abundama nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Ataagura omukono n'akazingiro k'eishokye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:8">1 Bus 12:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Akeetooranira ekicweka ky'ensi ekirikukira oburungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Ahakuba okwo niyo omugabo gw'omukuru w'engabo gwabaire gubiikirwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Yaija n'abandi bakuru b'eihanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Yaakwatanisa na Israeli okuhikiiriza ebiragiro bya MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">N'eby'oburyo bye ebi yaaragiire.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ahari Daani yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">Daani n'ekyana ky'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">Ekirikuguruka nikiruga Bashani.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ahari Nafutaali yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">Iwe Nafutaali, ohaagire obuganzi bwa MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">Oigutsi omugisha gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">Kubuura ensi y'oburengyerwa-izooba n'ey'obukiizi-bwa-buryo.<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />N'ahari Asheri yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Asheri aheebwe omugisha gw'okuzaara abaana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Akundwe beene ishe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Ajabikye ekigyere kye omu majuta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:6">Yob 29:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Empimbi zaawe zibe ebyoma n'emiringa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:25">Nk'oku ebiro byawe biriingana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:25">N'amaani gaawe nikwo gariba.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Iwe Yeshuruuni, tihariho ondiijo orikushushana na Ruhanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:26">Oritemba eiguru, naarirabamu kuza kukuhwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:26">Naaraba omu kaabunga n'ekitiinisa kye kingi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:4">Zab 68:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 68:33">33</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 68:34">34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Ruhanga otahwaho niwe butaaho bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Kandi ahansi yaawe hariho emikono etahwaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Akabinga abazigu omu maisho gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Yaagira ati: Bacwekyereze.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:1">Zab 46:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:18">Heb 6:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo Israeli atuura buhooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">Eiziba rya Yakobo erituura ryonka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">Omu nsi y'engano na viinyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">Eego, eiguru rye ritoonyereza orume.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:9">Kub 23:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Iwe Israeli, ohiiriirwe! N'oha orikushushana naiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Eihanga eryajunirwe MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Engabo y'okuhwerwa kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Kandi rurara y'okusingura kwawe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Abazigu baawe baryakugomookyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Oribatiirire emyanya yaabo mikuru ey'okuramizamu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 144:15">Zab 144:15</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:23">2 Sam 7:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Musa yaaruga omu mpita za Moabu, yaatemba orushozi Neebo, yaahika aha mutwe gwa Pisiga, ahashungaine na Yeriko. MUKAMA yaamworeka ensi ya Gileadi yoona okuhika Daani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />na Nafutaali yoona, n'ensi ya Efuraimu na Manaase n'ensi yoona eya Yuda okuhika aha Nyanja y'oburengyerwa-izooba; <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />yaamworeka na Negebu, n'oruhita rwa Yorudani, nirwo ruhanga rwa Yeriko orurembo rw'emikindo, okuhika Zoari. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Eriya niyo nsi ei naarahiire ningira Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo nti: Ndyagiha oruzaaro rwawe. Mbwenu naakwikiriza kugireeba n'amaisho, kwonka toryambuka kugizamu. <verse eid="DEU 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Atyo Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaafeera okwo omu nsi ya Moabu, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Yaamuziika omu ruhanga omu nsi ya Moabu ahashungaine na Besi-peori; kwonka tihariho orikumanya ahu ekituuro kye kiri n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa ogwo yaafa ahikize emyaka igana na makumi abiri, amaisho ge gatakagiirwemu ruho, n'amaani ge gatakatuubire. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Abaisraeli baamara ebiro makumi ashatu, nibacurira Musa omu mpita za Moabu. Bwanyima ebiro by'okuba omu rufu rwa Musa n'okumucurira byahwa.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 31:3">Kur 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:2">Isa 11:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:3">Dan 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:18">Kub 27:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoshua mwene Nuuni akaba aijwire omwoyo gw'obwengye; ahabw'okuba Musa akaba yaamutaireho engaro. Abaisraeli baamuhurira, baakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="DEU 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Bir 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 33:11">Kur 33:11</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga obwo tiharagarukire kubaho nabi ori nka Musa, ou MUKAMA yaabaire amanya, kandi akareebana nawe; <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />kandi tihariho owaakugyeragyeranisibwa nawe omu by'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza byona, ebi MUKAMA yaamutumire kukora omu nsi ya Misri, ahari Faraho n'abaheereza be boona, n'ensi ye yoona, <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />n'omu by'amaani maingi byona, n'ebirikutiinisa byona, ebi Musa yaakoreire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli boona.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>